(342135, 26739, 811, '<td valign="top">For me personally, I think the composition is a little to centered, and the strong horizontal lines in the background lead the eye away from the little girl.  Having said that, she looks like she would be fun to photograph.  She has a good "pose" and I like the expression on her face.</td>', 'For me personally, I think the composition is a little to centered, and the strong horizontal lines in the background lead the eye away from the little girl.  Having said that, she looks like she would be fun to photograph.  She has a good "pose" and I like the expression on her face.', '2003-06-30 01:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
