(342417, 26449, 3900, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.  But I''m torn by the frame leakage.  On the one hand it''s a neat looking effect; on the other hand, what is a frame for, if not to frame the photo.  Too bad you couldn''t spot edit that pixel on the lower left. -8.</td>', 'Great lighting.  But I''m torn by the frame leakage.  On the one hand it''s a neat looking effect; on the other hand, what is a frame for, if not to frame the photo.  Too bad you couldn''t spot edit that pixel on the lower left. -8.', '2003-06-30 04:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
