(342548, 26206, 8522, '<td valign="top">Really captures the essence of this buttercup, great concept. Love the way it almost blends in with the background. I''d have prefered a little less glare on the stem. Something about the composition bothers me... maybe I''d like the angle of the stem more shallow so there''s less white space at the right hand side. 9</td>', 'Really captures the essence of this buttercup, great concept. Love the way it almost blends in with the background. I''d have prefered a little less glare on the stem. Something about the composition bothers me... maybe I''d like the angle of the stem more shallow so there''s less white space at the right hand side. 9', '2003-06-30 08:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(342550, 26952, 5176, '<td valign="top">Amazing I really like the dramatic composition</td>', 'Amazing I really like the dramatic composition', '2003-06-30 08:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(342551, 26452, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, nice composition. A little overexposed for my taste, I''d have liked more detail in the sky and less glare in the sail. Boat could be sharper. 9</td>', 'Wonderful photo, nice composition. A little overexposed for my taste, I''d have liked more detail in the sky and less glare in the sail. Boat could be sharper. 9', '2003-06-30 08:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
