(342607, 26268, 3669, '<td valign="top">Oh WOW!  I must admit that I''ve been tiring of the flower and bug shots, but this one REALLY caught my attention.  It is wonderfully done, not to mention  interesting.  The red is so intense.  I assume you desaturated the colors except for the red channels.  It really works here.  I love the detail.  Excellent work 10+  My favorite for the week.</td>', 'Oh WOW!  I must admit that I''ve been tiring of the flower and bug shots, but this one REALLY caught my attention.  It is wonderfully done, not to mention  interesting.  The red is so intense.  I assume you desaturated the colors except for the red channels.  It really works here.  I love the detail.  Excellent work 10+  My favorite for the week.', '2003-06-30 10:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
