(342810, 26894, 811, '<td valign="top">Great idea (would also work well with the "unanswered questions" challenge, I think.  I like the "darkness" of the shot as it helps to set the mood.  I don''t like the framing as well though -- it feels "cut off" to me.</td>', 'Great idea (would also work well with the "unanswered questions" challenge, I think.  I like the "darkness" of the shot as it helps to set the mood.  I don''t like the framing as well though -- it feels "cut off" to me.', '2003-06-30 14:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
