(342815, 26843, 2152, '<td valign="top">Good color and contrast, excellent sharpness and great texture on the water drops.  But I''m wondering about the composition.  It''s too off-center to be considered centerd and not off center enough to be off-center.  It just doesn''t look right to me...</td>', 'Good color and contrast, excellent sharpness and great texture on the water drops.  But I''m wondering about the composition.  It''s too off-center to be considered centerd and not off center enough to be off-center.  It just doesn''t look right to me...', '2003-06-30 14:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(342818, 26951, 811, '<td valign="top">The dramatic lighting is very effective on this. Good idea.</td>', 'The dramatic lighting is very effective on this. Good idea.', '2003-06-30 14:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(342820, 26895, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the fact that you didn''t shoot it "head on," but it feels like it is falling off the hill and out of the frame to me.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the fact that you didn''t shoot it "head on," but it feels like it is falling off the hill and out of the frame to me.', '2003-06-30 14:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
