(342882, 26940, 3575, '<td valign="top">Nice muted colors and light. I like the old rose on the "antique" crochet piece. It works well for this shot. Maybe just a little more rose and less background. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice muted colors and light. I like the old rose on the "antique" crochet piece. It works well for this shot. Maybe just a little more rose and less background. Nice work.', '2003-06-30 15:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(342884, 26930, 3575, '<td valign="top">Ooooo, Great shot! Beautiful colors in the sky and grass and perfect perspective on the bridge. For those who are sticklers for the rule of thirds, you will make a lot of people happy with this one. A lot of time photos taken for challenges have no after challenge value but this could be a nice stock photo.</td>', 'Ooooo, Great shot! Beautiful colors in the sky and grass and perfect perspective on the bridge. For those who are sticklers for the rule of thirds, you will make a lot of people happy with this one. A lot of time photos taken for challenges have no after challenge value but this could be a nice stock photo.', '2003-06-30 15:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(342890, 26830, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and I really like the composition you have used!</td>', 'Beautiful colors and I really like the composition you have used!', '2003-06-30 15:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(342891, 26952, 3575, '<td valign="top">It''s a WOW. It looks like another world. I usually don''t like photos that make me turn my head to look at them but it was an excellent choice. 10 from me.</td>', 'It''s a WOW. It looks like another world. I usually don''t like photos that make me turn my head to look at them but it was an excellent choice. 10 from me.', '2003-06-30 15:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
