(342980, 26814, 2152, '<td valign="top">Good composition and I like the reflection.  I''m not sure the infrared is really necessary though.  It''s a cool effect sometimes, but I don''t think it makes enough of a difference here.</td>', 'Good composition and I like the reflection.  I''m not sure the infrared is really necessary though.  It''s a cool effect sometimes, but I don''t think it makes enough of a difference here.', '2003-06-30 16:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(343008, 26907, 4536, '<td valign="top">This brings back some memories, I''ve hiked to the top of this lookout, awesome, beautiful country.<br/>The photo looks a bit hazy, maybe earlier or later in the day or a polarizer filter to cut down the haze.</td>', 'This brings back some memories, I''ve hiked to the top of this lookout, awesome, beautiful country.The photo looks a bit hazy, maybe earlier or later in the day or a polarizer filter to cut down the haze.', '2003-06-30 17:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(343027, 26947, 2553, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually comment til the end of the week, if I have the time, but had to comment on this right away.  This is absolutely one of my favorites this week!  Great DOF, the black and white is perfect for it, your composition works so well, and his expression is wonderful!  Some peeps will probably "slam" you for the soft focus, but that''s what really makes this shot for me.  Heck, I''d hang it on MY wall, and I don''t even know the handsome young man!  Great work!  10</td>', 'I don''t usually comment til the end of the week, if I have the time, but had to comment on this right away.  This is absolutely one of my favorites this week!  Great DOF, the black and white is perfect for it, your composition works so well, and his expression is wonderful!  Some peeps will probably "slam" you for the soft focus, but that''s what really makes this shot for me.  Heck, I''d hang it on MY wall, and I don''t even know the handsome young man!  Great work!  10', '2003-06-30 17:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(343040, 26525, 1041, '<td valign="top">While you meet the challenge, your image is terribly out of focus and a bit overexposed.</td>', 'While you meet the challenge, your image is terribly out of focus and a bit overexposed.', '2003-06-30 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(343043, 26299, 1041, '<td valign="top">While you meet the challenge, the sun is totally overblown and the balloons are too dark.  Try not to use auto-exposure if you include great differences in light and dark.  Better even, frame so that the sun is not in the photo.  I do like how the three balloons are nicely lined up and make the eye flow through the image.</td>', 'While you meet the challenge, the sun is totally overblown and the balloons are too dark.  Try not to use auto-exposure if you include great differences in light and dark.  Better even, frame so that the sun is not in the photo.  I do like how the three balloons are nicely lined up and make the eye flow through the image.', '2003-06-30 18:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(343044, 26954, 1041, '<td valign="top">Quite a stunt action shot, plus you meet the challenge.  The background isn''t perfect but reasonably well controlled considering there''s bunches of people around etc.  The biggest issue you have with this photo is that it is out of focus.</td>', 'Quite a stunt action shot, plus you meet the challenge.  The background isn''t perfect but reasonably well controlled considering there''s bunches of people around etc.  The biggest issue you have with this photo is that it is out of focus.', '2003-06-30 18:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(343047, 26391, 1041, '<td valign="top">While you meet the challenge, your images is sized so small that it is difficult to critique the photo.  The maximum allowable size is 640x640, you used 230x178, this will hurt you on DPC.  Try to size your image closer to the maximum allowable size.  Email or PM me if you need help with that :)</td>', 'While you meet the challenge, your images is sized so small that it is difficult to critique the photo.  The maximum allowable size is 640x640, you used 230x178, this will hurt you on DPC.  Try to size your image closer to the maximum allowable size.  Email or PM me if you need help with that :)', '2003-06-30 18:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(343048, 26797, 1041, '<td valign="top">Well, you are skirting the edge of meeting the challenge, but I won''t quibble over your interpretation.  Fireworks are hard to photograph.  In this image, the center is very much overexposed and the rest underexposed.  There was a good discussion on photography of fireworks in the forums the other day.  I do like the line of smoke pointing upwards, that''s a nice inclusion.</td>', 'Well, you are skirting the edge of meeting the challenge, but I won''t quibble over your interpretation.  Fireworks are hard to photograph.  In this image, the center is very much overexposed and the rest underexposed.  There was a good discussion on photography of fireworks in the forums the other day.  I do like the line of smoke pointing upwards, that''s a nice inclusion.', '2003-06-30 18:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(343066, 26896, 4810, '<td valign="top">Bara snilld, enda Skagamenn þarna á ferð !</td>', 'Bara snilld, enda Skagamenn þarna á ferð !', '2003-06-30 19:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(343068, 26775, 9343, '<td valign="top">Very very clever! Wish i could vote as you get full marks for originality and composition :)<br/> <br/>Hope you do well</td>', 'Very very clever! Wish i could vote as you get full marks for originality and composition :) Hope you do well', '2003-06-30 19:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(343071, 26829, 7763, '<td valign="top">very nostalgic with nice tones</td>', 'very nostalgic with nice tones', '2003-06-30 19:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
