(343156, 26843, 9385, '<td valign="top">excellent close up, the water dropplets add alot. I think i would have used a pastel for the back round.</td>', 'excellent close up, the water dropplets add alot. I think i would have used a pastel for the back round.', '2003-06-30 20:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
