(343305, 26268, 2152, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I like how the bug''s wings match the red in the flower, broken up by the contrasting body.  Thorax?  Whatever...  And the dof is nice, too.  The frame may be a bit much, but a very good shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Great composition.  I like how the bug''s wings match the red in the flower, broken up by the contrasting body.  Thorax?  Whatever...  And the dof is nice, too.  The frame may be a bit much, but a very good shot nonetheless.', '2003-07-01 01:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
