(343417, 26613, 9331, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the colour really enhances this photo. I know it fits in with the B challenge, but it has some odd effects, like the two white dots on the finger and the oddly coloured finger nail. Also, because the title suggests to look at the chord being played, when you do the fingers appear slightly fuzzy (out of focus?).<br/>I do like the abstract idea though of meeting this challenge - well done (beats all those banana pictures :)</td>', 'Not sure if the colour really enhances this photo. I know it fits in with the B challenge, but it has some odd effects, like the two white dots on the finger and the oddly coloured finger nail. Also, because the title suggests to look at the chord being played, when you do the fingers appear slightly fuzzy (out of focus?).I do like the abstract idea though of meeting this challenge - well done (beats all those banana pictures :)', '2003-07-01 09:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(343418, 26845, 9331, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I have no idea what a bethel is but its a nice photo anyway.<br/>Pity that you couldn''t posted a larger size of this, as there''s so much detail in this photo, I''m sure it would have looked even better at a larger size</td>', 'Unfortunately, I have no idea what a bethel is but its a nice photo anyway.Pity that you couldn''t posted a larger size of this, as there''s so much detail in this photo, I''m sure it would have looked even better at a larger size', '2003-07-01 09:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
