(343421, 26447, 9331, '<td valign="top">Can''t complain about much here, great clarity and colours. Do feel the bush in front of the birds seems to be pushing them off the ledge, but its a minor point</td>', 'Can''t complain about much here, great clarity and colours. Do feel the bush in front of the birds seems to be pushing them off the ledge, but its a minor point', '2003-07-01 09:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(343422, 26952, 9331, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fascintaing - the angle is perfect, and I had to look for a while to see what the small objects were on the sand, which added to its intrigue. Finally realised that they were people climbing the dune and as soon as that happened, I was suddenly hit by the enormity of these sand dunes. Hope you get a ribbon for this little masterpiece !!</td>', 'Absolutely fascintaing - the angle is perfect, and I had to look for a while to see what the small objects were on the sand, which added to its intrigue. Finally realised that they were people climbing the dune and as soon as that happened, I was suddenly hit by the enormity of these sand dunes. Hope you get a ribbon for this little masterpiece !!', '2003-07-01 09:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(343424, 26442, 9331, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - but its a pity about the bottom blossom being so out of focus, My eyes keep getting drawn to it. The colours are great though :)</td>', 'Nice shot - but its a pity about the bottom blossom being so out of focus, My eyes keep getting drawn to it. The colours are great though :)', '2003-07-01 09:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
