(343430, 26299, 9331, '<td valign="top">It''s got B''s in it, but its a pity that the sun is behind them as the balloons have no colour or real definition at all. I''m just used to brightly coloured ballon pics.<br/>If this was a sunset pic, with the balloons silhouetted, it would have worked so much better</td>', 'It''s got B''s in it, but its a pity that the sun is behind them as the balloons have no colour or real definition at all. I''m just used to brightly coloured ballon pics.If this was a sunset pic, with the balloons silhouetted, it would have worked so much better', '2003-07-01 09:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
