(343520, 26949, 9504, '<td valign="top">Incredible sight!  If I could vote, you''d get a 10 from me.  Fabulous!</td>', 'Incredible sight!  If I could vote, you''d get a 10 from me.  Fabulous!', '2003-07-01 11:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(343521, 26902, 9504, '<td valign="top">Quite creative.  I like your interpretation...</td>', 'Quite creative.  I like your interpretation...', '2003-07-01 11:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(343524, 26670, 1041, '<td valign="top">Technically, wings starts with a ''W'', not a ''B'' ... but I get the point.  A unique capture, but despite that not the most appealing photo.  While your focus is good, the gravel in the water doesn''t add much to the image.  I''m totally curious where you took this, I''ve never seen a dragonfly with black wings before.</td>', 'Technically, wings starts with a ''W'', not a ''B'' ... but I get the point.  A unique capture, but despite that not the most appealing photo.  While your focus is good, the gravel in the water doesn''t add much to the image.  I''m totally curious where you took this, I''ve never seen a dragonfly with black wings before.', '2003-07-01 11:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(343526, 26896, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very awesome capture!  And two ''B''s to boot! :-P  Love everything about this shot, the blurred players in the background add to the scene but don''t try and steal the thunder from the action you captured.  You must''ve been sitting quite close or have a really nice lens.  Another action shot from Ridergal?  In any case, one of my top 5 picks this week :)</td>', 'Very awesome capture!  And two ''B''s to boot! :-P  Love everything about this shot, the blurred players in the background add to the scene but don''t try and steal the thunder from the action you captured.  You must''ve been sitting quite close or have a really nice lens.  Another action shot from Ridergal?  In any case, one of my top 5 picks this week :)', '2003-07-01 11:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(343547, 26947, 5964, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portait, the soft focus works well with this shot as does the depth of field, my only suggestion would be to have all of the subject in focus, the central part of the tshirt is out of focus. 9.</td>', 'This is a nice portait, the soft focus works well with this shot as does the depth of field, my only suggestion would be to have all of the subject in focus, the central part of the tshirt is out of focus. 9.', '2003-07-01 11:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(343551, 26929, 1, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured, great DOF, and the colors blend so well.</td>', 'Beautifully captured, great DOF, and the colors blend so well.', '2003-07-01 11:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(343553, 26889, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, great time of day too.</td>', 'Nicely framed, great time of day too.', '2003-07-01 11:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(343555, 26814, 1, '<td valign="top">Great use of IR, although the scene might be a little too busy -- there are almost too many things to look at.</td>', 'Great use of IR, although the scene might be a little too busy -- there are almost too many things to look at.', '2003-07-01 11:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(343563, 26006, 7857, '<td valign="top">A nice picture, great colours, good detail picked out on the surfaces, nice natural lighting. I don''t know how big the original shot was so this may be the biggest crop you could get but it''s a little small. Good luck.</td>', 'A nice picture, great colours, good detail picked out on the surfaces, nice natural lighting. I don''t know how big the original shot was so this may be the biggest crop you could get but it''s a little small. Good luck.', '2003-07-01 12:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(343567, 26855, 7857, '<td valign="top">Great picture, nice complementing colours from the mouthwash, brush AND paste! The reflection is a nice touch... the line down the glass is a bit strange but thats the only off thing! Should do well, good luck.</td>', 'Great picture, nice complementing colours from the mouthwash, brush AND paste! The reflection is a nice touch... the line down the glass is a bit strange but thats the only off thing! Should do well, good luck.', '2003-07-01 12:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(343569, 26441, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice choice, is this an artificial flower? Good colours, nice side on lighting and the soft focus looks great too.</td>', 'Nice choice, is this an artificial flower? Good colours, nice side on lighting and the soft focus looks great too.', '2003-07-01 12:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(343572, 26850, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, you probably didn''t need the border IMO, brilliant vibrant colours, great focus, good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice shot, you probably didn''t need the border IMO, brilliant vibrant colours, great focus, good luck with it.', '2003-07-01 12:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(343573, 26722, 7857, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge, nice soft colours. I like that you framed the boat off-centre and (whether it was or not) how the sun seems to shine from behine the building.</td>', 'Fits the challenge, nice soft colours. I like that you framed the boat off-centre and (whether it was or not) how the sun seems to shine from behine the building.', '2003-07-01 12:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(343577, 26609, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, lots of B''s so not question of not meeting the challenge. Nice angled framing of the bag, good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice shot, lots of B''s so not question of not meeting the challenge. Nice angled framing of the bag, good luck with it.', '2003-07-01 12:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(343579, 26417, 7857, '<td valign="top">Is that something in front of the glass bricks? Even if it isn''t a split in the glass I feel it would meet the challenge as it visually splits up the picture. Lots of procesing but the colours work well together, good luck with it.</td>', 'Is that something in front of the glass bricks? Even if it isn''t a split in the glass I feel it would meet the challenge as it visually splits up the picture. Lots of procesing but the colours work well together, good luck with it.', '2003-07-01 12:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(343581, 26894, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great idea... might have looked even better in a more homely setting (like on a living room table) as opposed to the black backdrop... should still do well here. Good luck - 8</td>', 'Nice shot, great idea... might have looked even better in a more homely setting (like on a living room table) as opposed to the black backdrop... should still do well here. Good luck - 8', '2003-07-01 12:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
