(343613, 26830, 9201, '<td valign="top">Magenta cast detracts from otherwise lovely image.</td>', 'Magenta cast detracts from otherwise lovely image.', '2003-07-01 13:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(343615, 26928, 9629, '<td valign="top">BRRR...<br/>Theme is haunting, like the way you have composed this.</td>', 'BRRR...Theme is haunting, like the way you have composed this.', '2003-07-01 13:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(343616, 26424, 9654, '<td valign="top">Beautuful colors!</td>', 'Beautuful colors!', '2003-07-01 13:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(343619, 26843, 811, '<td valign="top">Great focus and detail.  I also like the contrast between the blue and yellow.  I think it needs to be cropped just a touch more on the right, as it feels a bit unbalanced to me, or give it more "space" around the right and top.  Right now, it is just barely off of center, adn it makes it look "accidental," I think.</td>', 'Great focus and detail.  I also like the contrast between the blue and yellow.  I think it needs to be cropped just a touch more on the right, as it feels a bit unbalanced to me, or give it more "space" around the right and top.  Right now, it is just barely off of center, adn it makes it look "accidental," I think.', '2003-07-01 13:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(343620, 26775, 9700, '<td valign="top">pefect timing with the sun!</td>', 'pefect timing with the sun!', '2003-07-01 13:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(343643, 26913, 3575, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I love the colors, and especially like the negative space above the flower.</td>', 'Gorgeous! I love the colors, and especially like the negative space above the flower.', '2003-07-01 13:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(343649, 26832, 3575, '<td valign="top">LOL. A mind works in mysterious ways :)</td>', 'LOL. A mind works in mysterious ways :)', '2003-07-01 13:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(343651, 26800, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful flower, really nice colors.  The short focal range pretty good since the most important elements seem very sharp.  Don''t mean to blow your title, but I''m 99% certain that''s a wasp, not exactly a bee.  Still, it''s a pretty shot.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'It''s a beautiful flower, really nice colors.  The short focal range pretty good since the most important elements seem very sharp.  Don''t mean to blow your title, but I''m 99% certain that''s a wasp, not exactly a bee.  Still, it''s a pretty shot.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-07-01 13:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(343652, 26896, 811, '<td valign="top">Great capture!!</td>', 'Great capture!!', '2003-07-01 13:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(343653, 26835, 1379, '<td valign="top">That blue is unreal.  Such a glorious shot.  Your composition and framing are excellent.</td>', 'That blue is unreal.  Such a glorious shot.  Your composition and framing are excellent.', '2003-07-01 13:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(343654, 26851, 1379, '<td valign="top">This is like a glorious postcard.  The framing of the posts is great, giving it a movie-screen kind of look.  Awesome.</td>', 'This is like a glorious postcard.  The framing of the posts is great, giving it a movie-screen kind of look.  Awesome.', '2003-07-01 13:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(343656, 26775, 1379, '<td valign="top">Heh.... brickhenge.  Funny!  I really like the sky in the background, with those expressive little clouds gracing the works.</td>', 'Heh.... brickhenge.  Funny!  I really like the sky in the background, with those expressive little clouds gracing the works.', '2003-07-01 13:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(343657, 26635, 3575, '<td valign="top">It''s great that you have the woman in the photo to add perspective as to the size of the rocks, and a touch of color. This is a very intresting photo that could be in a travel magazine. It''s artistic and documentary. Nice.</td>', 'It''s great that you have the woman in the photo to add perspective as to the size of the rocks, and a touch of color. This is a very intresting photo that could be in a travel magazine. It''s artistic and documentary. Nice.', '2003-07-01 13:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(343658, 26206, 2344, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this image. I love it so much I''m gonna have to give it a 10</td>', 'I absolutely love this image. I love it so much I''m gonna have to give it a 10', '2003-07-01 13:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(343659, 26818, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like that the details are visible on the butterfly, and the colors are good as well.<br/> <br/>Just a side note (and doesn''t effect the score) -- I think this border kinda detracts from the image. The inconsistent shape draws the eyes away from the butterfly, I think.  But that is just my opinion</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like that the details are visible on the butterfly, and the colors are good as well. Just a side note (and doesn''t effect the score) -- I think this border kinda detracts from the image. The inconsistent shape draws the eyes away from the butterfly, I think.  But that is just my opinion', '2003-07-01 13:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(343662, 26768, 811, '<td valign="top">Took me a second - hahahahah.</td>', 'Took me a second - hahahahah.', '2003-07-01 13:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(343664, 26896, 3575, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot! 10</td>', 'Amazing shot! 10', '2003-07-01 13:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(343665, 26851, 811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, and  the composition is strong too.  Great work.</td>', 'Wonderful colors, and  the composition is strong too.  Great work.', '2003-07-01 13:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(343666, 26206, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the yellow on yellow you have done here.  good work.</td>', 'I like the yellow on yellow you have done here.  good work.', '2003-07-01 13:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(343667, 26208, 811, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and focus.</td>', 'Good lighting and focus.', '2003-07-01 13:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(343668, 26909, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautifully artistick photo. I love the colors, although a bit dark. I think a little bit more contrast to bring out some more detail but this is a gorgeous shot. Nice, very nice.</td>', 'Beautifully artistick photo. I love the colors, although a bit dark. I think a little bit more contrast to bring out some more detail but this is a gorgeous shot. Nice, very nice.', '2003-07-01 13:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(343672, 26295, 1041, '<td valign="top">Two ''B''s, challenge definitely met.  I appreciate that you just had to capture the moment ... the expressions would be gone afterwards.  You framed them quite well for it, and the colors are nice.  Looks like you used neatimage or something to despeckle, the whole image has a ''missing texture'' kind of feel to me.  Also, since you already cropped close, I would''ve cropped just a little more on the right to get the cut off pole (?) out of the image altogether.  Last but not least, the lady walking into the little boy''s shoulder is a bit distracting, but again, if that was the only moment to take the shot, then there''s nothing you can do.</td>', 'Two ''B''s, challenge definitely met.  I appreciate that you just had to capture the moment ... the expressions would be gone afterwards.  You framed them quite well for it, and the colors are nice.  Looks like you used neatimage or something to despeckle, the whole image has a ''missing texture'' kind of feel to me.  Also, since you already cropped close, I would''ve cropped just a little more on the right to get the cut off pole (?) out of the image altogether.  Last but not least, the lady walking into the little boy''s shoulder is a bit distracting, but again, if that was the only moment to take the shot, then there''s nothing you can do.', '2003-07-01 14:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(343673, 26318, 1041, '<td valign="top">LOL ... too bad this isn''t a title competition ... but you meet the photo challenge, too.  As for the photo, it wouldn''t hold my interest long outside of the challenge, to be honest.  The colors seem a little muted, the whole image slightly soft.  However, it is a fun idea.</td>', 'LOL ... too bad this isn''t a title competition ... but you meet the photo challenge, too.  As for the photo, it wouldn''t hold my interest long outside of the challenge, to be honest.  The colors seem a little muted, the whole image slightly soft.  However, it is a fun idea.', '2003-07-01 14:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(343679, 26818, 3575, '<td valign="top">The detail of your frame pulls the eye away for the detail of the butterfly. Nice capture of the butterfly. Perhaps just a little sharper. I have tried numerous times to photograph a butterfly but I have yet to be successful. I even went to a butterfly exhibition and came back empty. So, I am very impressed with this shot.</td>', 'The detail of your frame pulls the eye away for the detail of the butterfly. Nice capture of the butterfly. Perhaps just a little sharper. I have tried numerous times to photograph a butterfly but I have yet to be successful. I even went to a butterfly exhibition and came back empty. So, I am very impressed with this shot.', '2003-07-01 14:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
