(344584, 26274, 3540, '<td valign="top">Hate the border.  Its dominating an otherwise good pic.  I don''t normally mark down for borders, but I think this one is distracting enough to make me knock it down a point.  Sorry but I think no border on this picture would''ve been the best thing.</td>', 'Hate the border.  Its dominating an otherwise good pic.  I don''t normally mark down for borders, but I think this one is distracting enough to make me knock it down a point.  Sorry but I think no border on this picture would''ve been the best thing.', '2003-07-02 06:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(344589, 26818, 3540, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the border.  Not a particularly good choice of border esp for this photo as it is crowding the left antenna.  It should have sufficient breathing room except for the border.  I hate marking down for them, but this one has gone too far.</td>', 'Don''t like the border.  Not a particularly good choice of border esp for this photo as it is crowding the left antenna.  It should have sufficient breathing room except for the border.  I hate marking down for them, but this one has gone too far.', '2003-07-02 06:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(344593, 26907, 9331, '<td valign="top">I''ll pass on the same wise advice I was given once for a similar shot. If you''re going to have trees in the foreground, then they shouldn''t have an uneven appearance otherwise they become a bit distracting and divert the eyes of the viewer. Also it helps to have a bit of interest in the sky with some cloud formations (but unfrtunately mother nature doesn''t always want to help us out there). Other than that it''s a very fine shot</td>', 'I''ll pass on the same wise advice I was given once for a similar shot. If you''re going to have trees in the foreground, then they shouldn''t have an uneven appearance otherwise they become a bit distracting and divert the eyes of the viewer. Also it helps to have a bit of interest in the sky with some cloud formations (but unfrtunately mother nature doesn''t always want to help us out there). Other than that it''s a very fine shot', '2003-07-02 06:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(344597, 26251, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of this barn.  I''m not sure what has happened to the sky but it looks very unnatural.</td>', 'I like the framing of this barn.  I''m not sure what has happened to the sky but it looks very unnatural.', '2003-07-02 06:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
