(344604, 26937, 9331, '<td valign="top">Great photo - you''ve kept it nice and simple, had a great idea that I haven''t seen anyone else do and the textures work really well.</td>', 'Great photo - you''ve kept it nice and simple, had a great idea that I haven''t seen anyone else do and the textures work really well.', '2003-07-02 06:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(344608, 26376, 9331, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you one for each B and another for the sunglasses (cos they look so cool)</td>', 'I''m giving you one for each B and another for the sunglasses (cos they look so cool)', '2003-07-02 06:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(344615, 26417, 9331, '<td valign="top">I had to look up "bifurcating" as I had no idea what it meant and got the following definition "to divide into two branches or parts" - so I''m still not sure what it has to do with this picture??</td>', 'I had to look up "bifurcating" as I had no idea what it meant and got the following definition "to divide into two branches or parts" - so I''m still not sure what it has to do with this picture??', '2003-07-02 06:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(344617, 26814, 9331, '<td valign="top">Infrared shot? WOW - it''s stunning !!</td>', 'Infrared shot? WOW - it''s stunning !!', '2003-07-02 06:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(344619, 26874, 9331, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit too much shadow on the main rhino, so I can''t see much detail in it</td>', 'There''s a bit too much shadow on the main rhino, so I can''t see much detail in it', '2003-07-02 06:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(344626, 26811, 9331, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - but my only complaint is that the rose appears to be bruised or starting to wither, as it appears there''s a lot of brown edging on the petals and especially on the top right petal - so it takes away from the "beautiful" aspect of it a bit</td>', 'Nice shot - but my only complaint is that the rose appears to be bruised or starting to wither, as it appears there''s a lot of brown edging on the petals and especially on the top right petal - so it takes away from the "beautiful" aspect of it a bit', '2003-07-02 06:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(344628, 26289, 9331, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant. Fits the challenge nicely. And you''ve done very well to make all the edges of the bowl discernable against the background - which I can''t imagine would have been a very easy shot to take</td>', 'Simple and elegant. Fits the challenge nicely. And you''ve done very well to make all the edges of the bowl discernable against the background - which I can''t imagine would have been a very easy shot to take', '2003-07-02 06:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(344632, 26832, 9331, '<td valign="top">I was almost gonna mark you down - cos my first thought was "Oh no - not another banana shot !!", but then I realised what I was looking at, so gonna give it a few extra marks for originality :)</td>', 'I was almost gonna mark you down - cos my first thought was "Oh no - not another banana shot !!", but then I realised what I was looking at, so gonna give it a few extra marks for originality :)', '2003-07-02 06:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(344635, 26822, 9331, '<td valign="top">Love the use of the profile shot here - and you''ve used good DOF to make sure we''re not distracted by anything in the backgorund</td>', 'Love the use of the profile shot here - and you''ve used good DOF to make sure we''re not distracted by anything in the backgorund', '2003-07-02 06:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(344640, 26909, 9331, '<td valign="top">Another bloom shot - but I do really like the colours in this one, compared to most of the others. So I''ve given you points for meeting the B challenge, the great use of DOF and colour, but taken them away for lack of originality and slight noise in the photo</td>', 'Another bloom shot - but I do really like the colours in this one, compared to most of the others. So I''ve given you points for meeting the B challenge, the great use of DOF and colour, but taken them away for lack of originality and slight noise in the photo', '2003-07-02 06:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(344643, 26855, 9331, '<td valign="top">Love the subtle hint of blues and greens in this photo. The black background works really well to help focus our attention on the tooth brush and the reflection helps add to the overall appeal of this shot. Very well done</td>', 'Love the subtle hint of blues and greens in this photo. The black background works really well to help focus our attention on the tooth brush and the reflection helps add to the overall appeal of this shot. Very well done', '2003-07-02 06:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(344647, 26690, 9331, '<td valign="top">It''s nice - but it''s just another one of the many bloom shots entered for this challenge, so lacks a bit in originality</td>', 'It''s nice - but it''s just another one of the many bloom shots entered for this challenge, so lacks a bit in originality', '2003-07-02 06:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(344652, 26884, 9331, '<td valign="top">The detail you''ve captured in this macro is excellent - but what really helps make this photo stand out, is the way you''ve captured the bug at such an angle that the yellow stripe down the bugs back really helps lift it out from the background and give it a sense of 3-dimensionality. Great shot - one of my favourites for this challenge</td>', 'The detail you''ve captured in this macro is excellent - but what really helps make this photo stand out, is the way you''ve captured the bug at such an angle that the yellow stripe down the bugs back really helps lift it out from the background and give it a sense of 3-dimensionality. Great shot - one of my favourites for this challenge', '2003-07-02 06:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(344655, 26854, 9331, '<td valign="top">My first thought was "Another banana shot", so feel it lacks a little in originality because so many other''s entered banana shots as well. But you did get a double B for the challenge, so gonna award you extra points for that (and I do like your choice of background too)</td>', 'My first thought was "Another banana shot", so feel it lacks a little in originality because so many other''s entered banana shots as well. But you did get a double B for the challenge, so gonna award you extra points for that (and I do like your choice of background too)', '2003-07-02 06:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(344658, 26861, 9331, '<td valign="top">Gettysburg? I think I''ve taken the exact same shot when I visited there last year.<br/>Great choice of subject for the challenge, and the duotone works well</td>', 'Gettysburg? I think I''ve taken the exact same shot when I visited there last year.Great choice of subject for the challenge, and the duotone works well', '2003-07-02 06:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(344660, 26888, 9331, '<td valign="top">More bananas - AARRRGGHH . Sorry just joking :)</td>', 'More bananas - AARRRGGHH . Sorry just joking :)', '2003-07-02 06:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(344668, 26449, 9331, '<td valign="top">As to the reference to "Tasty"  - well unfortunately after sitting through about 20 banana photos, the last thing I feel like eating is a banana - LOL<br/>It''s a nice shot, (little unoriginal), but I do find the border distracting</td>', 'As to the reference to "Tasty"  - well unfortunately after sitting through about 20 banana photos, the last thing I feel like eating is a banana - LOLIt''s a nice shot, (little unoriginal), but I do find the border distracting', '2003-07-02 06:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(344670, 26875, 9331, '<td valign="top">Iinteresting composition - and the title is very clever :) Good choice of background colour too, as it suits the mood of the photo</td>', 'Iinteresting composition - and the title is very clever :) Good choice of background colour too, as it suits the mood of the photo', '2003-07-02 06:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(344673, 26836, 9331, '<td valign="top">I think this must be the first time I''ve ever looked at broccoli close up. Interesting idea for the challenge !!</td>', 'I think this must be the first time I''ve ever looked at broccoli close up. Interesting idea for the challenge !!', '2003-07-02 06:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(344682, 26428, 9331, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. Very unique - love the colour and  the way our eyes are drawn to see how this photo was done</td>', 'This is excellent. Very unique - love the colour and  the way our eyes are drawn to see how this photo was done', '2003-07-02 06:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(344685, 26858, 9331, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, but the green looks a little oversaturated</td>', 'Great clarity, but the green looks a little oversaturated', '2003-07-02 06:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(344689, 26843, 9331, '<td valign="top">Its a nice shot and good use of background colour, but being off centre just doesn''t look right to me</td>', 'Its a nice shot and good use of background colour, but being off centre just doesn''t look right to me', '2003-07-02 06:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(344690, 26775, 9331, '<td valign="top">hehe - clever :)</td>', 'hehe - clever :)', '2003-07-02 06:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(344691, 26683, 9331, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and composition of this, but I find the reflection of the lights a little distracting</td>', 'Love the angle and composition of this, but I find the reflection of the lights a little distracting', '2003-07-02 06:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(344692, 26938, 9331, '<td valign="top">I would have made it a Blue Bayou ;)</td>', 'I would have made it a Blue Bayou ;)', '2003-07-02 06:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(344705, 26452, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, nice off-centre shot... unless it was a miserable day this would probably look good in colour too (though you''d know better than me). Nice crisp shot, good luck.</td>', 'Nice photo, nice off-centre shot... unless it was a miserable day this would probably look good in colour too (though you''d know better than me). Nice crisp shot, good luck.', '2003-07-02 07:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(344706, 26880, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nice that the cuts are a bit rough round the edges... good idea to keep the scissors in there too.</td>', 'Nice idea, nice that the cuts are a bit rough round the edges... good idea to keep the scissors in there too.', '2003-07-02 07:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(344746, 26912, 7086, '<td valign="top">Seems to lack sharpness IMO</td>', 'Seems to lack sharpness IMO', '2003-07-02 08:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(344750, 26429, 7086, '<td valign="top">Hat is over-exposed and there is a lighter patch in the background top-right, composition is too much to the top.</td>', 'Hat is over-exposed and there is a lighter patch in the background top-right, composition is too much to the top.', '2003-07-02 08:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(344751, 26525, 7086, '<td valign="top">Appears to have been shot with too low a shutter speed resulting in shake.</td>', 'Appears to have been shot with too low a shutter speed resulting in shake.', '2003-07-02 08:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(344771, 26391, 7086, '<td valign="top">Too small</td>', 'Too small', '2003-07-02 08:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(344772, 26896, 7086, '<td valign="top">Very well captured action shot</td>', 'Very well captured action shot', '2003-07-02 08:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(344774, 26289, 7086, '<td valign="top">Great concept &amp; execution</td>', 'Great concept & execution', '2003-07-02 08:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(344778, 26299, 7086, '<td valign="top">Shooting into the light has caused the baloons to be underexposed</td>', 'Shooting into the light has caused the baloons to be underexposed', '2003-07-02 08:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(344781, 26768, 7086, '<td valign="top">Clever concept, poor execution. Image is too blurry and the second CD case adds nothing IMO</td>', 'Clever concept, poor execution. Image is too blurry and the second CD case adds nothing IMO', '2003-07-02 08:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(344782, 26318, 7086, '<td valign="top">Like the idea, unfortunately too soft and jpeg compression visible</td>', 'Like the idea, unfortunately too soft and jpeg compression visible', '2003-07-02 08:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(344786, 26836, 7086, '<td valign="top">I like it, DOF is just right for the concept</td>', 'I like it, DOF is just right for the concept', '2003-07-02 08:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(344788, 26775, 7857, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept and (IMO) perfectly executed. Very creative, nice colours, would be very interested to know how this was done... fill in flash to get the colour of the brick? Great job, should do really well - 10</td>', 'This is a great concept and (IMO) perfectly executed. Very creative, nice colours, would be very interested to know how this was done... fill in flash to get the colour of the brick? Great job, should do really well - 10', '2003-07-02 08:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(344791, 26889, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, I like the way the perspective almost cuts a triangle of sky towards the left (and leading towards the sun?). Good colours, great shot.</td>', 'Nice subject, I like the way the perspective almost cuts a triangle of sky towards the left (and leading towards the sun?). Good colours, great shot.', '2003-07-02 08:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(344794, 26417, 7086, '<td valign="top">OK so I admit I had to check what bifurcating meant! As pop art it may work well but it''s too busy for me.</td>', 'OK so I admit I had to check what bifurcating meant! As pop art it may work well but it''s too busy for me.', '2003-07-02 08:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(344795, 26433, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... the yellow flag is a nice intrusion into the blue of the sky. Great job</td>', 'Nice shot... the yellow flag is a nice intrusion into the blue of the sky. Great job', '2003-07-02 08:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(344798, 26779, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... more DOF would be good (but I know from my camera I can''t get that kind of control)... I think a 180° rotation so the bug was walking out the top of the photo would look slightly better. Good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice shot... more DOF would be good (but I know from my camera I can''t get that kind of control)... I think a 180° rotation so the bug was walking out the top of the photo would look slightly better. Good luck with it.', '2003-07-02 08:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(344799, 26663, 7086, '<td valign="top">It''s probably been said before but the lighting has totally blown the detail around the eyes.</td>', 'It''s probably been said before but the lighting has totally blown the detail around the eyes.', '2003-07-02 08:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(344800, 26933, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, the colours are brought out nicely...  dont know why but I like the that they''re leaning over as opposed to just upright. Good luck</td>', 'Nice subject, the colours are brought out nicely...  dont know why but I like the that they''re leaning over as opposed to just upright. Good luck', '2003-07-02 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(344805, 26952, 7086, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective, I like being able to appreciate the scale by the inclusion of people, I don''t like that it looks like a computer generated image - the sand is too bland (but that''s not your fault). What''s it like at different times of the day?</td>', 'I like the perspective, I like being able to appreciate the scale by the inclusion of people, I don''t like that it looks like a computer generated image - the sand is too bland (but that''s not your fault). What''s it like at different times of the day?', '2003-07-02 08:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(344813, 26832, 7857, '<td valign="top">lol, excellent idea, very creative, nicely carried out... the colours work very well together, I can see this being placed high. Well done.</td>', 'lol, excellent idea, very creative, nicely carried out... the colours work very well together, I can see this being placed high. Well done.', '2003-07-02 09:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(344830, 26811, 7086, '<td valign="top">Detail very well captured</td>', 'Detail very well captured', '2003-07-02 09:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(344831, 26850, 7086, '<td valign="top">Made me smile</td>', 'Made me smile', '2003-07-02 09:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(344833, 26799, 7086, '<td valign="top">Too much light in the eyes to see the colour easily</td>', 'Too much light in the eyes to see the colour easily', '2003-07-02 09:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(344835, 26635, 7086, '<td valign="top">Is this really the colour of the ground?</td>', 'Is this really the colour of the ground?', '2003-07-02 09:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(344888, 26935, 4338, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the DOF is great also, i personally feel the lighting could be a little bit stronger, but this still works very well.....</td>', 'I like the colors and the DOF is great also, i personally feel the lighting could be a little bit stronger, but this still works very well.....', '2003-07-02 10:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(344893, 26169, 4338, '<td valign="top">cool bug... colors look great to me....</td>', 'cool bug... colors look great to me....', '2003-07-02 10:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(344900, 26833, 4338, '<td valign="top">nice shot, too bad the sky was overcast</td>', 'nice shot, too bad the sky was overcast', '2003-07-02 10:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(344903, 26938, 4338, '<td valign="top">not sure if its just me, but this looks to be out of focus or has a really soft focus and not very sharp, the colors are good</td>', 'not sure if its just me, but this looks to be out of focus or has a really soft focus and not very sharp, the colors are good', '2003-07-02 10:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(344915, 26635, 7857, '<td valign="top">The colours are a bit drab (but theres nothing you can do about that really i suppose), its good that there''s someone in the frame to add scale to it, nice sharp focus. A nice idea, just not very appealing. Good luck with it.</td>', 'The colours are a bit drab (but theres nothing you can do about that really i suppose), its good that there''s someone in the frame to add scale to it, nice sharp focus. A nice idea, just not very appealing. Good luck with it.', '2003-07-02 10:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(344919, 26873, 7857, '<td valign="top">mmmm...very nice. Great lighting, really brings out the golden colour of the beer, nice slow shutter speed, all round good photo.</td>', 'mmmm...very nice. Great lighting, really brings out the golden colour of the beer, nice slow shutter speed, all round good photo.', '2003-07-02 10:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(344924, 26113, 7857, '<td valign="top">A very good concept, but a very cluttered picture... 3 combs and a load of clips may be a bit too much here. The brush adds a nice change in colour and the textures come out really well. Good luck.</td>', 'A very good concept, but a very cluttered picture... 3 combs and a load of clips may be a bit too much here. The brush adds a nice change in colour and the textures come out really well. Good luck.', '2003-07-02 10:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(344927, 26289, 7857, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot... the white on white is a nice effect, and leaving some space at the top (for me) lets you visualise the stacking of even more bowls on top. Would probably look good on a black or red background as well. Nicely executed, good job.</td>', 'Very nice shot... the white on white is a nice effect, and leaving some space at the top (for me) lets you visualise the stacking of even more bowls on top. Would probably look good on a black or red background as well. Nicely executed, good job.', '2003-07-02 10:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(344928, 26829, 8843, '<td valign="top">belle blossoming! :D</td>', 'belle blossoming! :D', '2003-07-02 10:56:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(344937, 26753, 8843, '<td valign="top">So pretty! Must have been difficult to focus?</td>', 'So pretty! Must have been difficult to focus?', '2003-07-02 11:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(344940, 26251, 8488, '<td valign="top">That''s infrared, isn''t it? Huh. I like what the odd colors do to the image.</td>', 'That''s infrared, isn''t it? Huh. I like what the odd colors do to the image.', '2003-07-02 11:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(344941, 26636, 8488, '<td valign="top">The lighting and focus are indistinct enought o make it hard to focus on the beans - maybe a darker/non-red bowl would have given better contrast? 5.</td>', 'The lighting and focus are indistinct enought o make it hard to focus on the beans - maybe a darker/non-red bowl would have given better contrast? 5.', '2003-07-02 11:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(344944, 26525, 8488, '<td valign="top">This is rather unfortunately fuzzy-and-grainy. Maybe a slightly smaller image size (or less jpg compression?) could have turned it from ''flawed'' to ''meeting the challenge but unobjectionable technically'' - which to me is the difference between 4 and 5.</td>', 'This is rather unfortunately fuzzy-and-grainy. Maybe a slightly smaller image size (or less jpg compression?) could have turned it from ''flawed'' to ''meeting the challenge but unobjectionable technically'' - which to me is the difference between 4 and 5.', '2003-07-02 11:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(344945, 26088, 8488, '<td valign="top">Well, technically, you made the *cork* the center and main focus of the image, but. :-&gt; 7,</td>', 'Well, technically, you made the *cork* the center and main focus of the image, but. :-> 7,', '2003-07-02 11:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(344946, 26289, 8488, '<td valign="top">Finally, a *good* use of high-key! Man. I get kind of frustrated with people washing out their shots and trying to be stylish. This is a use I approve of, however. Makes a gorgeous abstract out of something that clearly fits the topic on first glance (title unneeded to explain). 10.</td>', 'Finally, a *good* use of high-key! Man. I get kind of frustrated with people washing out their shots and trying to be stylish. This is a use I approve of, however. Makes a gorgeous abstract out of something that clearly fits the topic on first glance (title unneeded to explain). 10.', '2003-07-02 11:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(344948, 26912, 8488, '<td valign="top">Hmm. There''s a kind of busy-ness in the similarity of mid-grey tones - perhaps a slightly different angle when shot could have gotten the barbers against the mirror, or just one barber with a less muddled background or surroundings to distract the eye from where you want it to go? 5 (fits topic well enough, no glaring technical flaws, but not eye-catchingly appealing either).</td>', 'Hmm. There''s a kind of busy-ness in the similarity of mid-grey tones - perhaps a slightly different angle when shot could have gotten the barbers against the mirror, or just one barber with a less muddled background or surroundings to distract the eye from where you want it to go? 5 (fits topic well enough, no glaring technical flaws, but not eye-catchingly appealing either).', '2003-07-02 11:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(344949, 26947, 8488, '<td valign="top">I love this image as a portrait, and as ''portrait'' or ''kids'' or ''direct gaze'' or some such topic, it could get a 9 or 10 from me. However, the topic isn''t blatantly obvious as you look at it (other than ''boy'', I suppose), without the title''s explanation, so that detracts from it a bit for me in this competition (YMMV, IMHO, pant pant). 6.</td>', 'I love this image as a portrait, and as ''portrait'' or ''kids'' or ''direct gaze'' or some such topic, it could get a 9 or 10 from me. However, the topic isn''t blatantly obvious as you look at it (other than ''boy'', I suppose), without the title''s explanation, so that detracts from it a bit for me in this competition (YMMV, IMHO, pant pant). 6.', '2003-07-02 11:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(344954, 26873, 8488, '<td valign="top">The play of light in this takes my breath away, and the first glance brings out the connection with the topic immediately (to me, anyway). The lighting is so damn amazing. If I have to find SOMETHING critical to say, I would add that I don''t see what the border brings to it (just letting the edge end blackly would work as well, to me). :-&gt; 10.</td>', 'The play of light in this takes my breath away, and the first glance brings out the connection with the topic immediately (to me, anyway). The lighting is so damn amazing. If I have to find SOMETHING critical to say, I would add that I don''t see what the border brings to it (just letting the edge end blackly would work as well, to me). :-> 10.', '2003-07-02 11:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(345029, 26295, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good picture but the backround is distracting.</td>', 'Good picture but the backround is distracting.', '2003-07-02 12:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(345091, 26613, 7890, '<td valign="top">cool shot, I like the work here,  good challenge, 8</td>', 'cool shot, I like the work here,  good challenge, 8', '2003-07-02 12:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(345094, 26952, 7890, '<td valign="top">wils shot, love the angle, very creative.</td>', 'wils shot, love the angle, very creative.', '2003-07-02 12:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
