(346076, 26616, 1202, '<td valign="top">A very well composed shot with very effective use of depth of field.   It might have been a bit better if the bubbles did not go past the edge, this has a tendency to lead one out of the frame.   Nice work though.  7</td>', 'A very well composed shot with very effective use of depth of field.   It might have been a bit better if the bubbles did not go past the edge, this has a tendency to lead one out of the frame.   Nice work though.  7', '2003-07-03 11:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
