(346092, 26831, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro.  I like the shadows on its neck and the clarity of its eye.  I don''t especially care for the wash out on the bill, which is quite noticeable due to the dark background.  5</td>', 'Very nice macro.  I like the shadows on its neck and the clarity of its eye.  I don''t especially care for the wash out on the bill, which is quite noticeable due to the dark background.  5', '2003-07-03 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
