(346484, 26854, 6771, '<td valign="top">The color on this seems off.  I am expecting to see a creamy yellowish color on the banana.  Possibly a bit oversaturated and in need of a touch more light, larger aperture.  May have brought more detail to the fly also?</td>', 'The color on this seems off.  I am expecting to see a creamy yellowish color on the banana.  Possibly a bit oversaturated and in need of a touch more light, larger aperture.  May have brought more detail to the fly also?', '2003-07-03 20:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
