(346734, 26113, 6388, '<td valign="top">finally a title that''s not so obvious it hurts.  don''t love thelighting in this.  looks like you used a natural source behind the pic, which causes all kinds of flares on the brush and anything silver.  a flash with a diffuser or a reflected studio light would help.  I like the setup though.</td>', 'finally a title that''s not so obvious it hurts.  don''t love thelighting in this.  looks like you used a natural source behind the pic, which causes all kinds of flares on the brush and anything silver.  a flash with a diffuser or a reflected studio light would help.  I like the setup though.', '2003-07-04 03:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
