(346859, 26907, 3540, '<td valign="top">The trees in front look sort of oversaturated, whether natural or not.   I think a level adjustment on the yellows would blend them in a little more.  I think its good they stand out, but only to a point.  The haziness of this picture covers up some of the good detail in the hill in the background</td>', 'The trees in front look sort of oversaturated, whether natural or not.   I think a level adjustment on the yellows would blend them in a little more.  I think its good they stand out, but only to a point.  The haziness of this picture covers up some of the good detail in the hill in the background', '2003-07-04 10:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
