(346868, 26914, 3540, '<td valign="top">Please get those burger off there soon.  They are starting to look like charcoal.  Thanks for making me hungry.  I''d leave a longer comment but I have to get some breakfast now.  Using a border was a good idea, just not this thick.</td>', 'Please get those burger off there soon.  They are starting to look like charcoal.  Thanks for making me hungry.  I''d leave a longer comment but I have to get some breakfast now.  Using a border was a good idea, just not this thick.', '2003-07-04 10:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
