(346874, 26447, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the colors on this.  They aren''t vibrant, but they have a very nice warm tone to them.  Looks like it was taken on an overcast day.  I like the front bird, how he''s "talking".  Good shot 7</td>', 'I like the colors on this.  They aren''t vibrant, but they have a very nice warm tone to them.  Looks like it was taken on an overcast day.  I like the front bird, how he''s "talking".  Good shot 7', '2003-07-04 10:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
