(346922, 26690, 3540, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the lighting.  Looks almost like you used the flash.  The highlights on the leaves are just too much and there are too many of them.   Good crisp clear picture, just don''t like the lighting.</td>', 'Don''t like the lighting.  Looks almost like you used the flash.  The highlights on the leaves are just too much and there are too many of them.   Good crisp clear picture, just don''t like the lighting.', '2003-07-04 11:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
