(347365, 26954, 7339, '<td valign="top">While I like this photo and think that stopies are very cool. I rated this photo lower then I would have if it was sharper. I am sure he was moving pretty quick. I would have also tried to position myself to get the rider in back more if it helped or less if he wasnt doing anything but his head above the back seat is a bit distracting.</td>', 'While I like this photo and think that stopies are very cool. I rated this photo lower then I would have if it was sharper. I am sure he was moving pretty quick. I would have also tried to position myself to get the rider in back more if it helped or less if he wasnt doing anything but his head above the back seat is a bit distracting.', '2003-07-05 02:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
