(347388, 26874, 3469, '<td valign="top">For some reason pictures on DPC look much darker than what they look like on your own system. This is something to take into account for the picture you submit. The shadows on this picture are far too dark to my taste. I imported it into PS and pulled up the gamma to 1.20 with a much better result. It turned out to be a very nice picture indeed.</td>', 'For some reason pictures on DPC look much darker than what they look like on your own system. This is something to take into account for the picture you submit. The shadows on this picture are far too dark to my taste. I imported it into PS and pulled up the gamma to 1.20 with a much better result. It turned out to be a very nice picture indeed.', '2003-07-05 05:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
