(347592, 26912, 7711, '<td valign="top">What a sweet composition, especially with both a boy and a man getting their hair cut. A bit of a levels or a contrast adjustment would help because all the tones are in the greys right, without anything that is truly black (though there are true whites I think)<br/> <br/>Well done! :)</td>', 'What a sweet composition, especially with both a boy and a man getting their hair cut. A bit of a levels or a contrast adjustment would help because all the tones are in the greys right, without anything that is truly black (though there are true whites I think) Well done! :)', '2003-07-05 17:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(347609, 26878, 7711, '<td valign="top">mmm....delicious. I''m a carb-fiend. I like this crowded composition, but I think the light seems a bit too bright, maybe something dimmer or moodier would have faired well too? As it is, some of the bread seems just a bit washed out without any really interesting shadows or highlights.</td>', 'mmm....delicious. I''m a carb-fiend. I like this crowded composition, but I think the light seems a bit too bright, maybe something dimmer or moodier would have faired well too? As it is, some of the bread seems just a bit washed out without any really interesting shadows or highlights.', '2003-07-05 18:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(347615, 26896, 7711, '<td valign="top">that looks really painful!! Really good focus though, with the two players tack sharp and the rest faded into the background blur, keeps our attention on the action!</td>', 'that looks really painful!! Really good focus though, with the two players tack sharp and the rest faded into the background blur, keeps our attention on the action!', '2003-07-05 18:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(347643, 26347, 7711, '<td valign="top">very nice dof. lighting is good too, no harsh shadows. Not sure what it is about this shot, but I really like it. 8</td>', 'very nice dof. lighting is good too, no harsh shadows. Not sure what it is about this shot, but I really like it. 8', '2003-07-05 18:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(347644, 26832, 7711, '<td valign="top">How adorable and creative! This is just wonderful. :) Composition is cute, its like he''s sleeping on a rug, though I don''t know if I like the blue paper so much..did you try other shades too? Maybe a purple?</td>', 'How adorable and creative! This is just wonderful. :) Composition is cute, its like he''s sleeping on a rug, though I don''t know if I like the blue paper so much..did you try other shades too? Maybe a purple?', '2003-07-05 18:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(347645, 26935, 7711, '<td valign="top">very nice macro. I like the detail you have captured, and your perspective makes me think of the side of a great untouched mountain.</td>', 'very nice macro. I like the detail you have captured, and your perspective makes me think of the side of a great untouched mountain.', '2003-07-05 18:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(347652, 26363, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this one - however, it seems the main area of interest is above, where the opening lets you see the corner of the building above, as well as the shape of the hole leading upward. Yet that area is slightly too light and somewhat out of focus - it looks like the camera''s focus was on the lower area, the ceiling of where you were standing. I''m not sure if that was intentional on your part - it just doesn''t seem to fit the composition you''ve created, which draws the eye to the upper center. (The composition works great for me - I just wonder if a different focus/exposure might have made it even stronger.)</td>', 'I like this one - however, it seems the main area of interest is above, where the opening lets you see the corner of the building above, as well as the shape of the hole leading upward. Yet that area is slightly too light and somewhat out of focus - it looks like the camera''s focus was on the lower area, the ceiling of where you were standing. I''m not sure if that was intentional on your part - it just doesn''t seem to fit the composition you''ve created, which draws the eye to the upper center. (The composition works great for me - I just wonder if a different focus/exposure might have made it even stronger.)', '2003-07-05 18:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(347654, 26929, 472, '<td valign="top">one of the coolest. nice light, composition, and selective DOF.9.</td>', 'one of the coolest. nice light, composition, and selective DOF.9.', '2003-07-05 18:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
