(347670, 26875, 6388, '<td valign="top">as always - bonus point because it''s beer.  like the idea, very good lighting.  might have liked it from a little higher angle to level out the word Guinness and the lines above and below it (on the half-pint).</td>', 'as always - bonus point because it''s beer.  like the idea, very good lighting.  might have liked it from a little higher angle to level out the word Guinness and the lines above and below it (on the half-pint).', '2003-07-05 20:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(347671, 26825, 9297, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting!  I''ll bet it took some work to get the glow through the liquid you wanted, and a legible label.  You did a great job.  Composition is also aces!  If I were a member, you''d get a ''10''  :P</td>', 'Wonderful lighting!  I''ll bet it took some work to get the glow through the liquid you wanted, and a legible label.  You did a great job.  Composition is also aces!  If I were a member, you''d get a ''10''  :P', '2003-07-05 20:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(347672, 26912, 9297, '<td valign="top">Very funny!  Your title is wonderfully clever.  <br/> <br/>I think the black and white is more than a gimmick, though.  It helps the composition.  I don''t thinkI would like this photo in colour...I have a feeling it would be too ''busy''.  With the b&amp;w it''s very elegant, and the contrasts carry it well.</td>', 'Very funny!  Your title is wonderfully clever.   I think the black and white is more than a gimmick, though.  It helps the composition.  I don''t thinkI would like this photo in colour...I have a feeling it would be too ''busy''.  With the b&w it''s very elegant, and the contrasts carry it well.', '2003-07-05 20:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(347673, 26739, 9297, '<td valign="top">Your title made me laugh, and what a cute little girl!  You might want to try cropping some of the sky...when I scroll down so it''s not all visible, I don''t get as strong an impression that her head is floating.</td>', 'Your title made me laugh, and what a cute little girl!  You might want to try cropping some of the sky...when I scroll down so it''s not all visible, I don''t get as strong an impression that her head is floating.', '2003-07-05 20:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(347674, 26834, 9297, '<td valign="top">Oh, how wonderful!  What a lucky sighting!  You did a great job with the focus and the lighting.</td>', 'Oh, how wonderful!  What a lucky sighting!  You did a great job with the focus and the lighting.', '2003-07-05 20:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(347677, 26829, 9297, '<td valign="top">Your colours are very nice.  Just enough tint in the dress, her lips, and her skin that the white blossom doesn''t bleach her out.  Good work on the balance there!</td>', 'Your colours are very nice.  Just enough tint in the dress, her lips, and her skin that the white blossom doesn''t bleach her out.  Good work on the balance there!', '2003-07-05 20:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
