(347729, 26944, 806, '<td valign="top">excellent idea.. I am wishing that the B is a bit clearer. .. don''t have a suggestion on how to make that happen. Also, a bit of reflected light across the top of the binoculars would improve the detail and depth (in the mid region). Looks like these binoculars have been thru the mil. Nice subject.</td>', 'excellent idea.. I am wishing that the B is a bit clearer. .. don''t have a suggestion on how to make that happen. Also, a bit of reflected light across the top of the binoculars would improve the detail and depth (in the mid region). Looks like these binoculars have been thru the mil. Nice subject.', '2003-07-05 23:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
