(347866, 26866, 6325, '<td valign="top">Thanks for submitting. To make the subject bees stand out more, I suggest getting closer, make sure they are in focus, and have a little less exposure so they are not so washed out.</td>', 'Thanks for submitting. To make the subject bees stand out more, I suggest getting closer, make sure they are in focus, and have a little less exposure so they are not so washed out.', '2003-07-06 09:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(347870, 26442, 6325, '<td valign="top">The colors in the flower are very nice. I would like to see the top flower more in focus. I don''t think the second flower enhances the subject; however, a third flower to fill the upper right area might have worked. Compositionally, subjects are better represented in odd numbers - for images this size, 1 or 3 seems best.</td>', 'The colors in the flower are very nice. I would like to see the top flower more in focus. I don''t think the second flower enhances the subject; however, a third flower to fill the upper right area might have worked. Compositionally, subjects are better represented in odd numbers - for images this size, 1 or 3 seems best.', '2003-07-06 09:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(347872, 26347, 6325, '<td valign="top">The detail in the stonework on the left side is well done. I wish I could read the whole inscription.</td>', 'The detail in the stonework on the left side is well done. I wish I could read the whole inscription.', '2003-07-06 09:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
