(347891, 26954, 8911, '<td valign="top">The focus on this one could be a bit crisper, thought obviously with this subject the number of retakes is probably limited. :) Incredible composition and timing to get this one.</td>', 'The focus on this one could be a bit crisper, thought obviously with this subject the number of retakes is probably limited. :) Incredible composition and timing to get this one.', '2003-07-06 11:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(347892, 26935, 8911, '<td valign="top">A unique take on the challenge, and a very effective one, though I own that I might not have realized it was bark without the title. I like the focus, the way only the nearest parts of the bark are kept crisp.</td>', 'A unique take on the challenge, and a very effective one, though I own that I might not have realized it was bark without the title. I like the focus, the way only the nearest parts of the bark are kept crisp.', '2003-07-06 11:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(347893, 26742, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I looks as though it is starting to fall apart from too much enlargement, or the focus is soft on th bee.   How does it look with less crop / more of original?  8</td>', 'Nice shot.  I looks as though it is starting to fall apart from too much enlargement, or the focus is soft on th bee.   How does it look with less crop / more of original?  8', '2003-07-06 11:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(347897, 26931, 8911, '<td valign="top">Thank you for a good chuckle. This meets the challenge well, and I like the choice of an unusual subject.</td>', 'Thank you for a good chuckle. This meets the challenge well, and I like the choice of an unusual subject.', '2003-07-06 11:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(347898, 26299, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the balloons, but the glare of the sun makes them dim and hard to make out details - I think I''d rather have seen them either brighter, or fully as silhouettes. (Given the odds that the breeze would just move them on your whim, I suspect silhouettes would be the more possible of those two....) I wish the upper left balloon didn''t slip slightly out of the frame - it draws my eye out of the picture. Except for that less-than-centimeter placement, I like the composition, the curve they form.</td>', 'I like the balloons, but the glare of the sun makes them dim and hard to make out details - I think I''d rather have seen them either brighter, or fully as silhouettes. (Given the odds that the breeze would just move them on your whim, I suspect silhouettes would be the more possible of those two....) I wish the upper left balloon didn''t slip slightly out of the frame - it draws my eye out of the picture. Except for that less-than-centimeter placement, I like the composition, the curve they form.', '2003-07-06 11:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(347900, 26844, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a sweet photo, and a touching one. That little gesture says so much, especially with the title you chose. The composition is gorgeous. The boy being slightly out of focus adds to it, as it both softens him and suggests his focus on the flower and the girl. Good one!</td>', 'This is a sweet photo, and a touching one. That little gesture says so much, especially with the title you chose. The composition is gorgeous. The boy being slightly out of focus adds to it, as it both softens him and suggests his focus on the flower and the girl. Good one!', '2003-07-06 11:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(347902, 26817, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the sense of activity - the way many of the beese are blurred with motion - but also the still focus on a couple near the center who are not moving at this moment. This is a very effective picture, and somewhat unnerving - I''m not sure I want to be as close to the bees as you''ve brought us. :) Good one!</td>', 'Nice. I like the sense of activity - the way many of the beese are blurred with motion - but also the still focus on a couple near the center who are not moving at this moment. This is a very effective picture, and somewhat unnerving - I''m not sure I want to be as close to the bees as you''ve brought us. :) Good one!', '2003-07-06 11:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(347903, 26413, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty. I like the way the delicate line of the blossoms is balanced by the small upward jut of the table, and the use of negative space to outline the flowers and set them glowing. The careful simplicity of this works really well.</td>', 'This is very pretty. I like the way the delicate line of the blossoms is balanced by the small upward jut of the table, and the use of negative space to outline the flowers and set them glowing. The careful simplicity of this works really well.', '2003-07-06 11:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(347904, 26896, 9604, '<td valign="top">Great action shot!  You caught the action at just the right moment!</td>', 'Great action shot!  You caught the action at just the right moment!', '2003-07-06 11:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(347908, 26835, 8911, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. The lighting - the way the whole picture glows without washing out any part of it.... The composition. If I could quantify what I liked about that, I would, but...very well done.</td>', 'Gorgeous. The lighting - the way the whole picture glows without washing out any part of it.... The composition. If I could quantify what I liked about that, I would, but...very well done.', '2003-07-06 11:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
