(347940, 26910, 7711, '<td valign="top">at first I thought this was a line of bottles and I was going to suggest that you space them evening and all at the same tilt, but now I see its a mirror, and just one bottle! ;) I like the image, but its really too small to tell about the picture. Colour seems great, but some strange jaggies from jpeg compression. Dsidwell has a great forum post on how to size pictures for submissions that you might find helpful! cheers! <br/> <br/>P</td>', 'at first I thought this was a line of bottles and I was going to suggest that you space them evening and all at the same tilt, but now I see its a mirror, and just one bottle! ;) I like the image, but its really too small to tell about the picture. Colour seems great, but some strange jaggies from jpeg compression. Dsidwell has a great forum post on how to size pictures for submissions that you might find helpful! cheers!  P', '2003-07-06 13:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(347956, 26779, 9262, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at a macro shot. Your subject is cropped too much in the lower left and I don''t think that the negative space of the bark enhances your composition.</td>', 'Good attempt at a macro shot. Your subject is cropped too much in the lower left and I don''t think that the negative space of the bark enhances your composition.', '2003-07-06 14:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
