(347985, 26930, 2764, '<td valign="top">I find the border confining where the mmod of the bridge and field is expansive.  8</td>', 'I find the border confining where the mmod of the bridge and field is expansive.  8', '2003-07-06 15:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(347987, 26829, 2764, '<td valign="top">ooooh - I love desaturated photos (take a look at Zeisman''s).  This is a gorgeous portrait and I like the symbolizm too.  I can''t decide if I like the crowded feel or if I wish there was a tiny bit more room over her right eyebrow and under the flower''s stamen.  I think I do like the way you have cropped it - 9</td>', 'ooooh - I love desaturated photos (take a look at Zeisman''s).  This is a gorgeous portrait and I like the symbolizm too.  I can''t decide if I like the crowded feel or if I wish there was a tiny bit more room over her right eyebrow and under the flower''s stamen.  I think I do like the way you have cropped it - 9', '2003-07-06 15:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(348009, 26097, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice seagull shot. Is that Sandy Neck Beach on the Cape?</td>', 'Nice seagull shot. Is that Sandy Neck Beach on the Cape?', '2003-07-06 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(348012, 26909, 7711, '<td valign="top">seems just a tad dark (or underexposed) but the colours are still vibrant.</td>', 'seems just a tad dark (or underexposed) but the colours are still vibrant.', '2003-07-06 16:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(348018, 26452, 7711, '<td valign="top">lovely framing and good choice of bw. Composition really gives us a feel of the weather and the water and this tall boat. :)</td>', 'lovely framing and good choice of bw. Composition really gives us a feel of the weather and the water and this tall boat. :)', '2003-07-06 16:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(348020, 26929, 7711, '<td valign="top">Great DOF! We don''t know what the beast is that is so close to us, but we can see that its eye is very clearly pointed at us. Nice perspective, creative shot!</td>', 'Great DOF! We don''t know what the beast is that is so close to us, but we can see that its eye is very clearly pointed at us. Nice perspective, creative shot!', '2003-07-06 16:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(348023, 26775, 7711, '<td valign="top">this is one of my favourites of the challenge! Funny, and I like the flare of sun in the corner, makes the bricks seem very mighty, until you see the grass! Just a cute idea executed nicely. Colours are vibrant, but not overpowering. Well done.</td>', 'this is one of my favourites of the challenge! Funny, and I like the flare of sun in the corner, makes the bricks seem very mighty, until you see the grass! Just a cute idea executed nicely. Colours are vibrant, but not overpowering. Well done.', '2003-07-06 16:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(348024, 26635, 7711, '<td valign="top">the desaturation brings our attention to the size of the rocks, and your composition clearly directs our eyes to that hammerhead balanced boulder..well done. Was the colour version too bright to keep in colour?</td>', 'the desaturation brings our attention to the size of the rocks, and your composition clearly directs our eyes to that hammerhead balanced boulder..well done. Was the colour version too bright to keep in colour?', '2003-07-06 16:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(348025, 26206, 7711, '<td valign="top">wow. Wow. WOW. This is so simple, but so so beautiful. Yellows are hard to photography well, and you''ve done a magnificent job. I hope to add this to my favourites once the challenge is over. Its like high key but with yellow. How creative and beautifully executed. I love the lighting from the upper left. Tthe yellow gradient and highlights on the buttercup are super! 10</td>', 'wow. Wow. WOW. This is so simple, but so so beautiful. Yellows are hard to photography well, and you''ve done a magnificent job. I hope to add this to my favourites once the challenge is over. Its like high key but with yellow. How creative and beautifully executed. I love the lighting from the upper left. Tthe yellow gradient and highlights on the buttercup are super! 10', '2003-07-06 16:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(348026, 26851, 7711, '<td valign="top">I like the natural framing of this.. its like a letterbox movie, and the shot has a real cinematographic feel to it. Beautiful colours, crisp and clear photograph. Well done!! 10</td>', 'I like the natural framing of this.. its like a letterbox movie, and the shot has a real cinematographic feel to it. Beautiful colours, crisp and clear photograph. Well done!! 10', '2003-07-06 17:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(348029, 26525, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of this but the focus needs to be a lot sharper.</td>', 'I like the colors of this but the focus needs to be a lot sharper.', '2003-07-06 17:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(348031, 26113, 9262, '<td valign="top">This is the start of a good idea, but the dirty tools are not very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'This is the start of a good idea, but the dirty tools are not very pleasing to the eye.', '2003-07-06 17:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(348032, 26811, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like the softness if the petals, but the lighting is too bright.</td>', 'I like the softness if the petals, but the lighting is too bright.', '2003-07-06 17:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(348033, 26274, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot of a bee, but the lighting is very bright and washes out the flower in the back and the border does not enhance your image.</td>', 'Nice macro shot of a bee, but the lighting is very bright and washes out the flower in the back and the border does not enhance your image.', '2003-07-06 17:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(348035, 26834, 9262, '<td valign="top">The curve of the tree leads your eye to the left to the leaves and fence away from your subject.</td>', 'The curve of the tree leads your eye to the left to the leaves and fence away from your subject.', '2003-07-06 17:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(348036, 26363, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice angles and perspective in this image.</td>', 'Nice angles and perspective in this image.', '2003-07-06 17:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(348037, 26616, 7711, '<td valign="top">not fond of the border because it cuts into her face and into the bubbles, but I like the composition, and the DOF (blurred bg especially). :)</td>', 'not fond of the border because it cuts into her face and into the bubbles, but I like the composition, and the DOF (blurred bg especially). :)', '2003-07-06 17:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(348038, 26429, 9262, '<td valign="top">What is that thing behind your bottle of Bravas? It''s very distracting.</td>', 'What is that thing behind your bottle of Bravas? It''s very distracting.', '2003-07-06 17:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(348040, 26914, 9262, '<td valign="top">Yum. I like the idea of this composition. The flames &amp; smoke in the upper right are a bit disctracting.</td>', 'Yum. I like the idea of this composition. The flames & smoke in the upper right are a bit disctracting.', '2003-07-06 17:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(348041, 26318, 9262, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but the focus needs to be a bit sharper on your main subject, the bears in the boat.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but the focus needs to be a bit sharper on your main subject, the bears in the boat.', '2003-07-06 17:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(348042, 26797, 9262, '<td valign="top">The smoke trail down the left side leads your eye down the frame away from your subject.</td>', 'The smoke trail down the left side leads your eye down the frame away from your subject.', '2003-07-06 17:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(348043, 26895, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leading lines.</td>', 'Nice use of leading lines.', '2003-07-06 17:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(348044, 26832, 9262, '<td valign="top">Everytime I looked at this shot, I thought the line near the top of the banana was the mouth and wondered what the little things near the bottom are. Now, I can see the dog near the bottom of the banana.</td>', 'Everytime I looked at this shot, I thought the line near the top of the banana was the mouth and wondered what the little things near the bottom are. Now, I can see the dog near the bottom of the banana.', '2003-07-06 17:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(348045, 26441, 9262, '<td valign="top">This is interesting with the colors and textures. Some noise in the background.</td>', 'This is interesting with the colors and textures. Some noise in the background.', '2003-07-06 17:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(348046, 26117, 9262, '<td valign="top">Power lines draw your attention away from main subject. A little too much foreground.</td>', 'Power lines draw your attention away from main subject. A little too much foreground.', '2003-07-06 17:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(348048, 26616, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. The border does not enhance your image.</td>', 'Nice DOF. The border does not enhance your image.', '2003-07-06 17:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(348049, 26954, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Would be better if focus were a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice capture. Would be better if focus were a bit sharper.', '2003-07-06 17:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(348050, 26849, 7711, '<td valign="top">ooh...dark and low key... what a great mood created by the lighting and the subject. I wish he wasn''t facing the camera, but was intense in his music facing maybe to our left instead, but still..great use of light and shadow to create mood! 9</td>', 'ooh...dark and low key... what a great mood created by the lighting and the subject. I wish he wasn''t facing the camera, but was intense in his music facing maybe to our left instead, but still..great use of light and shadow to create mood! 9', '2003-07-06 17:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(348051, 26753, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like your composition but I don''t think the shallow DOF works here.</td>', 'I like your composition but I don''t think the shallow DOF works here.', '2003-07-06 17:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(348054, 26806, 9262, '<td valign="top">I tried something like this myself. The lighting creates some glare and washes out the colors a bit.</td>', 'I tried something like this myself. The lighting creates some glare and washes out the colors a bit.', '2003-07-06 17:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(348055, 26739, 9262, '<td valign="top">Cute subject even if she is a little centered.</td>', 'Cute subject even if she is a little centered.', '2003-07-06 17:30:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(348056, 26663, 9262, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s me but I can''t tel if you were going for a high key effect or not.</td>', 'Maybe it''s me but I can''t tel if you were going for a high key effect or not.', '2003-07-06 17:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(348057, 26878, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like your composition but the colors and textures of the loaves are all the same which makes it a bit boring.</td>', 'I like your composition but the colors and textures of the loaves are all the same which makes it a bit boring.', '2003-07-06 17:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(348059, 26289, 7711, '<td valign="top">I adore highkey! Creative composition, perfectly light and exposed!! I like the curves and use of negative space.</td>', 'I adore highkey! Creative composition, perfectly light and exposed!! I like the curves and use of negative space.', '2003-07-06 17:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(348060, 26814, 7711, '<td valign="top">is this IR? The reflections are great, and I like the detail of the trees. Very nice perspective/composition. I like the amount of bridge, water and trees in the shot.</td>', 'is this IR? The reflections are great, and I like the detail of the trees. Very nice perspective/composition. I like the amount of bridge, water and trees in the shot.', '2003-07-06 17:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(348062, 26844, 9262, '<td valign="top">I love this image. I think it belongs in a magazine.</td>', 'I love this image. I think it belongs in a magazine.', '2003-07-06 17:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(348063, 26814, 9262, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I don''t usually go for landscapes, but the combination of IR and the reflection is outstanding.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I don''t usually go for landscapes, but the combination of IR and the reflection is outstanding.', '2003-07-06 17:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(348064, 26952, 9262, '<td valign="top">Great perspective &amp; composition.</td>', 'Great perspective & composition.', '2003-07-06 17:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(348065, 26849, 9262, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition. Good interpretation of challenge. Love the play on words.</td>', 'Great lighting and composition. Good interpretation of challenge. Love the play on words.', '2003-07-06 17:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(348067, 26376, 9262, '<td valign="top">Good composition, lighting, subject. I like how the patterened blouse stands out from your simple background.</td>', 'Good composition, lighting, subject. I like how the patterened blouse stands out from your simple background.', '2003-07-06 17:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(348068, 26289, 9262, '<td valign="top">Very simple but very effective. One of my favorites from the start.</td>', 'Very simple but very effective. One of my favorites from the start.', '2003-07-06 17:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(348069, 26884, 9262, '<td valign="top">I want one! Great macro of a bug. Love the colors.</td>', 'I want one! Great macro of a bug. Love the colors.', '2003-07-06 17:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(348070, 26947, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF. Good use of B&amp;W.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF. Good use of B&W.', '2003-07-06 17:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(348071, 26428, 9262, '<td valign="top">Neat :) I wanna know how you did this one. I like how your face is framed in the bottom of the B</td>', 'Neat :) I wanna know how you did this one. I like how your face is framed in the bottom of the B', '2003-07-06 17:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(348072, 26836, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice macro of broccoli. This would have been a good entry for Unanswered Questions. Nice use of colors with the background and subject.</td>', 'Nice macro of broccoli. This would have been a good entry for Unanswered Questions. Nice use of colors with the background and subject.', '2003-07-06 17:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(348073, 26822, 9262, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me want to pop that bubble :) I don''t know if I like the soft tones. Would have liked to see this with a bit more contrast.</td>', 'This shot makes me want to pop that bubble :) I don''t know if I like the soft tones. Would have liked to see this with a bit more contrast.', '2003-07-06 17:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(348074, 26206, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of this one. The composition is good and I like the use of a yelllow subject on the yellow background.</td>', 'I like the softness of this one. The composition is good and I like the use of a yelllow subject on the yellow background.', '2003-07-06 17:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(348075, 26829, 9262, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites of this challenge. I love the softness of this portrait and the juxtaposition of the blossom and the little girl. Beautiful :)</td>', 'This is one of my favorites of this challenge. I love the softness of this portrait and the juxtaposition of the blossom and the little girl. Beautiful :)', '2003-07-06 17:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(348076, 26875, 9262, '<td valign="top">Super use of light. I really like how the curves are matched up between the glasses.</td>', 'Super use of light. I really like how the curves are matched up between the glasses.', '2003-07-06 17:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(348077, 26691, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasting colors of this image and the curves of the bamboo.</td>', 'I like the contrasting colors of this image and the curves of the bamboo.', '2003-07-06 17:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(348078, 26935, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and DOF in this one. This might be good in B&amp;W</td>', 'Nice textures and DOF in this one. This might be good in B&W', '2003-07-06 17:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(348080, 26424, 5728, '<td valign="top">I really like the detail and colors in this image. The composition is also fantastic. I''m just a little iffy about it meeting the challenge though - 8.</td>', 'I really like the detail and colors in this image. The composition is also fantastic. I''m just a little iffy about it meeting the challenge though - 8.', '2003-07-06 17:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(348082, 26825, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, the lighting is bang on! The red seems to be a little too harsh, especially at the top of the glass at the lower part of the foam. Other than that, top image!</td>', 'Good idea, the lighting is bang on! The red seems to be a little too harsh, especially at the top of the glass at the lower part of the foam. Other than that, top image!', '2003-07-06 17:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(348084, 26683, 6870, '<td valign="top">The tilt adds drama! I like it. Clear and crisp photo, too.</td>', 'The tilt adds drama! I like it. Clear and crisp photo, too.', '2003-07-06 17:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(348086, 26946, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and good choice for a point of view.</td>', 'Nice perspective and good choice for a point of view.', '2003-07-06 17:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(348088, 26706, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and I really like the composition here. It might be fun to experiment with putting him off center, but then the focus would shift to him being in his world rather than on him alone. The blown out corner at bottom left fits this shot, I think.</td>', 'Interesting idea, and I really like the composition here. It might be fun to experiment with putting him off center, but then the focus would shift to him being in his world rather than on him alone. The blown out corner at bottom left fits this shot, I think.', '2003-07-06 17:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(348089, 26208, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good macro, the detail is spot on, everything is sharp and detailed. I think if you had had the lighting in differently, this would have been excellent! It just seems a little blown out in places on the right and a tad to bland on the left of the ashtray, otherwise very good!</td>', 'Good macro, the detail is spot on, everything is sharp and detailed. I think if you had had the lighting in differently, this would have been excellent! It just seems a little blown out in places on the right and a tad to bland on the left of the ashtray, otherwise very good!', '2003-07-06 17:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(348090, 26251, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light here. Bizarre sky that has a lot of grain. I love the bright light on the roof of each section.</td>', 'Wonderful light here. Bizarre sky that has a lot of grain. I love the bright light on the roof of each section.', '2003-07-06 17:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(348092, 26940, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good, the detail in the flower is bang on. A little grainy in the background but otherwise a top pic!</td>', 'This is good, the detail in the flower is bang on. A little grainy in the background but otherwise a top pic!', '2003-07-06 17:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(348093, 26449, 6870, '<td valign="top">Looks good. I love the light here.</td>', 'Looks good. I love the light here.', '2003-07-06 17:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(348094, 26113, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice, evocative photo. I love the many little details. Looks slightly unsharp, perhaps from a cheaper camera? Certainly forgiveable with the wonderful composition and splash of color in upper left.</td>', 'Nice, evocative photo. I love the many little details. Looks slightly unsharp, perhaps from a cheaper camera? Certainly forgiveable with the wonderful composition and splash of color in upper left.', '2003-07-06 17:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(348095, 26896, 6870, '<td valign="top">Appropriate image and title. Very nice action captured, too!</td>', 'Appropriate image and title. Very nice action captured, too!', '2003-07-06 18:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(348096, 26877, 6870, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me happy for some reason. I suppose bananas do that to me! Nice composition and very effective lighting.</td>', 'This photo makes me happy for some reason. I suppose bananas do that to me! Nice composition and very effective lighting.', '2003-07-06 18:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(348097, 26413, 9262, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and textures in this image. Nice use of lighting and great compostition.</td>', 'I love the colors and textures in this image. Nice use of lighting and great compostition.', '2003-07-06 18:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(348098, 26394, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super color here, and the point of view and composition work so well together! 9</td>', 'Super color here, and the point of view and composition work so well together! 9', '2003-07-06 18:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(348099, 26896, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Good use of DOF</td>', 'Nice capture. Good use of DOF', '2003-07-06 18:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(348100, 26714, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice gull! But maybe I''m just gullible! This is one shot in which I think it may have been a better choice to put the bird slightly off focus, as it is a wild bird in a wild setting. Kind of. Well, I''m being nit picky. This shot has excellent lighting/exposure, nice details and is very engaging.</td>', 'Nice gull! But maybe I''m just gullible! This is one shot in which I think it may have been a better choice to put the bird slightly off focus, as it is a wild bird in a wild setting. Kind of. Well, I''m being nit picky. This shot has excellent lighting/exposure, nice details and is very engaging.', '2003-07-06 18:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(348101, 26251, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Like the colors.</td>', 'Nice composition. Like the colors.', '2003-07-06 18:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(348102, 26843, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super macro. Interesting lines and drops make for an engaging image! 9</td>', 'Super macro. Interesting lines and drops make for an engaging image! 9', '2003-07-06 18:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(348103, 26441, 5728, '<td valign="top">How did you get those textures in like that? I like the wavy effect, seems just a little dark for some reason tho.</td>', 'How did you get those textures in like that? I like the wavy effect, seems just a little dark for some reason tho.', '2003-07-06 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(348104, 26812, 6870, '<td valign="top">Superlative composition! Nice light capture too, with the boat framed by the highlighted water. The whole image seems a bit grainy or something, but exudes a very nice mood.</td>', 'Superlative composition! Nice light capture too, with the boat framed by the highlighted water. The whole image seems a bit grainy or something, but exudes a very nice mood.', '2003-07-06 18:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(348105, 26949, 6870, '<td valign="top">Man, I miss the ocean! Nice capture and I love  how you''ve taken an everyday object and made it into an interesting abstract.</td>', 'Man, I miss the ocean! Nice capture and I love  how you''ve taken an everyday object and made it into an interesting abstract.', '2003-07-06 18:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(348106, 26922, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super composition, and nice tones. I give you three extra points for using B three times!</td>', 'Super composition, and nice tones. I give you three extra points for using B three times!', '2003-07-06 18:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(348107, 26613, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super idea, composition, everything. I like the softish focus, too. 9</td>', 'Super idea, composition, everything. I like the softish focus, too. 9', '2003-07-06 18:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(348108, 26895, 6870, '<td valign="top">Hey, check out the Temples thread in the forums, today! I like the perspective here, with the arches leading to the temple. Lighting is super, too. Nice time of day to shoot as those walls glow. You might try experimenting and going in even tighter, even if you exclude some of the temple walls. It might add more drama, but I''m not sure. Nice work. 8</td>', 'Hey, check out the Temples thread in the forums, today! I like the perspective here, with the arches leading to the temple. Lighting is super, too. Nice time of day to shoot as those walls glow. You might try experimenting and going in even tighter, even if you exclude some of the temple walls. It might add more drama, but I''m not sure. Nice work. 8', '2003-07-06 18:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(348109, 26829, 6870, '<td valign="top">Stunning expression on this face. I love the grainy, soft look to this photo--it makes for a nostalgic, warm, old fashioned feel that works marvelously. Super work here. 10!</td>', 'Stunning expression on this face. I love the grainy, soft look to this photo--it makes for a nostalgic, warm, old fashioned feel that works marvelously. Super work here. 10!', '2003-07-06 18:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(348110, 26930, 6870, '<td valign="top">Is this a sequel? Nice bridge. The lighting is great! The most interesting part of this shot is the framework of the bridge, so I wish there were more of it. But I do like how it exists in its environment in this shot.</td>', 'Is this a sequel? Nice bridge. The lighting is great! The most interesting part of this shot is the framework of the bridge, so I wish there were more of it. But I do like how it exists in its environment in this shot.', '2003-07-06 18:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(348111, 26821, 6870, '<td valign="top">Two Bs gets an extra 2 points from me! Lovely bride, true, and composition works. Lighting is good, too. Try different points of view for more interest and drama, perhaps?</td>', 'Two Bs gets an extra 2 points from me! Lovely bride, true, and composition works. Lighting is good, too. Try different points of view for more interest and drama, perhaps?', '2003-07-06 18:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(348112, 26088, 6870, '<td valign="top">Unique and intriguing shot! I like it! DOF works very well for me here.</td>', 'Unique and intriguing shot! I like it! DOF works very well for me here.', '2003-07-06 18:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(348113, 26839, 6870, '<td valign="top">There has to be at least one red boat in every challenge! This is a nice one, and that mast and sky mix do wonders for this shot./</td>', 'There has to be at least one red boat in every challenge! This is a nice one, and that mast and sky mix do wonders for this shot./', '2003-07-06 18:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(348114, 26884, 6870, '<td valign="top">These, or similar ones, are conquering Eastern Utah right now as we speak. Nice intricate details captured. DOF is wonderful and contrasts the insect very nicely.</td>', 'These, or similar ones, are conquering Eastern Utah right now as we speak. Nice intricate details captured. DOF is wonderful and contrasts the insect very nicely.', '2003-07-06 18:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(348115, 26874, 4517, '<td valign="top">You have crammed in an awful lot of detail into 150kb. It`s a cracking photo but i can`t help but think you have played on the title to fit the challenge. I`ll give you the benifit of the doubt. 10</td>', 'You have crammed in an awful lot of detail into 150kb. It`s a cracking photo but i can`t help but think you have played on the title to fit the challenge. I`ll give you the benifit of the doubt. 10', '2003-07-06 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
