(348261, 26347, 6340, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of old Europe.</td>', 'I''m a fan of old Europe.', '2003-07-06 20:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(348262, 26866, 6340, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.</td>', 'Out of focus.', '2003-07-06 20:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(348265, 26873, 6340, '<td valign="top">I like how the light was used.</td>', 'I like how the light was used.', '2003-07-06 20:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(348266, 26929, 6340, '<td valign="top">Too close for my comfort but great picture.</td>', 'Too close for my comfort but great picture.', '2003-07-06 20:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(348267, 26299, 6340, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  We can''t appreciate the colorful balloons.</td>', 'Too dark.  We can''t appreciate the colorful balloons.', '2003-07-06 20:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(348268, 26268, 8860, '<td valign="top">Dead bug and bloom - so no struggle with the focus then?! Could have improved the angle of this shot to achieve some DOF on petals and get more detail from centre. [4]</td>', 'Dead bug and bloom - so no struggle with the focus then?! Could have improved the angle of this shot to achieve some DOF on petals and get more detail from centre. [4]', '2003-07-06 20:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(348269, 26829, 7242, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this shot. I love the softness, the mood, the cropping. I love everything about it. My favorite of the challenge. 10!</td>', 'I absolutely love this shot. I love the softness, the mood, the cropping. I love everything about it. My favorite of the challenge. 10!', '2003-07-06 20:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(348270, 26883, 6340, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused.</td>', 'Nicely focused.', '2003-07-06 20:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(348271, 26631, 6340, '<td valign="top">Well done.  The light plays well in this photograph.</td>', 'Well done.  The light plays well in this photograph.', '2003-07-06 20:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(348272, 26169, 8860, '<td valign="top">Wow. I only see thes on documentaries! [6]</td>', 'Wow. I only see thes on documentaries! [6]', '2003-07-06 20:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(348273, 26376, 7242, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot. Magazine quality. 10.</td>', 'Amazing shot. Magazine quality. 10.', '2003-07-06 20:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(348275, 26419, 6340, '<td valign="top">Too much sky.  Should have been cropped.</td>', 'Too much sky.  Should have been cropped.', '2003-07-06 20:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(348276, 26814, 8860, '<td valign="top">This looks like another cool IR shot. Nice composition and lighting. [7]</td>', 'This looks like another cool IR shot. Nice composition and lighting. [7]', '2003-07-06 20:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(348278, 26387, 8860, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft and mistargeted. [4]</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft and mistargeted. [4]', '2003-07-06 20:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(348279, 26914, 6405, '<td valign="top">You mean  Burned Beef?</td>', 'You mean  Burned Beef?', '2003-07-06 20:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(348282, 26844, 714, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!  Awesome shot.  the color of the flower against the beautiful dark skin is great.  Good luck.  10</td>', 'WOW!!!  Awesome shot.  the color of the flower against the beautiful dark skin is great.  Good luck.  10', '2003-07-06 20:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(348283, 26749, 714, '<td valign="top">Bad dog!!  this is a great shot.</td>', 'Bad dog!!  this is a great shot.', '2003-07-06 20:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(348286, 26749, 8637, '<td valign="top">Having the faces of these nest little guys showing would have helped...but I am sure it''s not easy to get them to pose!  Neat concept.</td>', 'Having the faces of these nest little guys showing would have helped...but I am sure it''s not easy to get them to pose!  Neat concept.', '2003-07-06 20:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(348287, 26872, 8637, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W but the image is askew/tilted...and catching one of these barges on the water might add more interest than just parked at the dock.</td>', 'Nice B&W but the image is askew/tilted...and catching one of these barges on the water might add more interest than just parked at the dock.', '2003-07-06 20:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(348288, 26844, 6405, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe that I''m seeing this kind of photo on DPC,this one is raising the bar of perfection,too bad I can''t give you more than 10!</td>', 'I can''t believe that I''m seeing this kind of photo on DPC,this one is raising the bar of perfection,too bad I can''t give you more than 10!', '2003-07-06 20:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(348289, 26829, 6405, '<td valign="top">Perfect 10 from me!</td>', 'Perfect 10 from me!', '2003-07-06 20:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(348299, 26817, 4811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors. What really gets me though is the feeling of movement in the picture, on top of that one bee remains sharp - you really captured the essence of what it must feel like to bee in a hive :)  One of my favorites this week -10</td>', 'Wonderful colors. What really gets me though is the feeling of movement in the picture, on top of that one bee remains sharp - you really captured the essence of what it must feel like to bee in a hive :)  One of my favorites this week -10', '2003-07-06 21:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(348300, 26952, 4811, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and sky - I like the fact that this photo looks like it could have been taken on another planet :) Therein lies the uniqueness of the photo. Definitely among my favorites this week.</td>', 'Great perspective and sky - I like the fact that this photo looks like it could have been taken on another planet :) Therein lies the uniqueness of the photo. Definitely among my favorites this week.', '2003-07-06 21:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(348301, 26948, 4811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful product shot. Could see it in a magazine! Very sharp focus, great texture - I can almost feel the brush and the pain on the can!! Excellent work! 10</td>', 'Wonderful product shot. Could see it in a magazine! Very sharp focus, great texture - I can almost feel the brush and the pain on the can!! Excellent work! 10', '2003-07-06 21:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(348304, 26895, 4811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light to light your temple! I think its very off topic though... I wouldn''t want to rely on the title to make me think of ''B''. Great shot otherwise.</td>', 'Beautiful light to light your temple! I think its very off topic though... I wouldn''t want to rely on the title to make me think of ''B''. Great shot otherwise.', '2003-07-06 21:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(348322, 26753, 6325, '<td valign="top">A nice concept. Left bubble is sharp and well focused.  I think the bubbles get lost in all the lights.</td>', 'A nice concept. Left bubble is sharp and well focused.  I think the bubbles get lost in all the lights.', '2003-07-06 22:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(348324, 26870, 6325, '<td valign="top">The color seems nice. More saturattion might make the colors stand out more. In general, the overall focus needs to be sharper in my opinion.</td>', 'The color seems nice. More saturattion might make the colors stand out more. In general, the overall focus needs to be sharper in my opinion.', '2003-07-06 22:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(348325, 26952, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the sky and the vastness of the dunes - the people seem so insignificant. The way they are all stretched out makes it look like they are on a quest. This angle does nothing for me and I think it distracts from an otherwise good shot.</td>', 'I like the sky and the vastness of the dunes - the people seem so insignificant. The way they are all stretched out makes it look like they are on a quest. This angle does nothing for me and I think it distracts from an otherwise good shot.', '2003-07-06 22:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(348326, 26924, 6325, '<td valign="top">The set-up is pretty nice. I think the soft focus would be appropriatei, but I think it should be consistent. across the image.</td>', 'The set-up is pretty nice. I think the soft focus would be appropriatei, but I think it should be consistent. across the image.', '2003-07-06 22:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(348327, 26829, 8307, '<td valign="top">Something about this photograph strikes me more than any other in this competition. Probably because she has a natural expression that just fits this photo well. Great shot</td>', 'Something about this photograph strikes me more than any other in this competition. Probably because she has a natural expression that just fits this photo well. Great shot', '2003-07-06 22:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(348329, 26779, 6325, '<td valign="top">I think putting the bug in a more central spot would be a stronger composition.</td>', 'I think putting the bug in a more central spot would be a stronger composition.', '2003-07-06 22:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(348330, 26391, 6325, '<td valign="top">A larger image would make the blossom more noticeable. The focus seems soft.</td>', 'A larger image would make the blossom more noticeable. The focus seems soft.', '2003-07-06 22:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(348333, 26938, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice location. The image could be sharper and higher contrast.</td>', 'Nice location. The image could be sharper and higher contrast.', '2003-07-06 22:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(348334, 26525, 6325, '<td valign="top">Colors are interesting. In my opinion, the focus does not quite work.</td>', 'Colors are interesting. In my opinion, the focus does not quite work.', '2003-07-06 22:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(348336, 26441, 6325, '<td valign="top">The wavy petals to the right are very nice. Lighting  and focus are uneven, which distracts from the image.</td>', 'The wavy petals to the right are very nice. Lighting  and focus are uneven, which distracts from the image.', '2003-07-06 22:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(348338, 26954, 6325, '<td valign="top">I think the image would be improved with sharper focus and more saturated colors.</td>', 'I think the image would be improved with sharper focus and more saturated colors.', '2003-07-06 22:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(348340, 26816, 6325, '<td valign="top">I hope they continue to read. Maybe opening the left door would have prevented the flash glare and covered the thermostat.</td>', 'I hope they continue to read. Maybe opening the left door would have prevented the flash glare and covered the thermostat.', '2003-07-06 22:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(348342, 26268, 9652, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus...nice image!</td>', 'Excellent focus...nice image!', '2003-07-06 22:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(348343, 26829, 9652, '<td valign="top">Beautiful young lady, beautiful flower...one of my favorites!</td>', 'Beautiful young lady, beautiful flower...one of my favorites!', '2003-07-06 22:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(348344, 26912, 9652, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, excellent focus...reminds me of where my father used to take me...</td>', 'Nice composition, excellent focus...reminds me of where my father used to take me...', '2003-07-06 22:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(348346, 26742, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. Nice bee capture,too! Colors seem just a tad washed, but the direction its coming from makes great shadows!</td>', 'Lovely composition. Nice bee capture,too! Colors seem just a tad washed, but the direction its coming from makes great shadows!', '2003-07-06 23:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(348347, 26861, 6870, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I''m not sure B/W is the best choice as the grays of the cannons are more difficult to distinguish from the grays of the trees behind. The grass in front does make a nice foreground presentation, though. Nice work.</td>', 'Great idea! I''m not sure B/W is the best choice as the grays of the cannons are more difficult to distinguish from the grays of the trees behind. The grass in front does make a nice foreground presentation, though. Nice work.', '2003-07-06 23:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(348348, 26650, 6870, '<td valign="top">Your point of view from above adds interest to this shot.</td>', 'Your point of view from above adds interest to this shot.', '2003-07-06 23:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(348350, 26889, 6870, '<td valign="top">That is one cool bridge, and you chose the perfect time of day for this shot--the light is coming from a terrific direction. I think I''d like to see it a little darker to bring more contrast between the bridge and its surroundings, though. Nice work.</td>', 'That is one cool bridge, and you chose the perfect time of day for this shot--the light is coming from a terrific direction. I think I''d like to see it a little darker to bring more contrast between the bridge and its surroundings, though. Nice work.', '2003-07-06 23:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(348351, 26937, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant. The wreath adds just enough of a touch to bring a lot more interest here.</td>', 'Simple and elegant. The wreath adds just enough of a touch to bring a lot more interest here.', '2003-07-06 23:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(348352, 26872, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones here. Striking, in fact! Composition is a little busy on the right, but the lighting and B/W work very well here!</td>', 'Very nice tones here. Striking, in fact! Composition is a little busy on the right, but the lighting and B/W work very well here!', '2003-07-06 23:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(348354, 26424, 6870, '<td valign="top">Spurious title, but the clarity and interest here outweigh that for me. Wonderful lighting and intriguing details.8</td>', 'Spurious title, but the clarity and interest here outweigh that for me. Wonderful lighting and intriguing details.8', '2003-07-06 23:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(348355, 26902, 6870, '<td valign="top">Oh so subtle, but wonderful. One of my favorites. Superious composition and I love the wry humor that is subtly present here. Tones and lighting are marvelous,too. 10</td>', 'Oh so subtle, but wonderful. One of my favorites. Superious composition and I love the wry humor that is subtly present here. Tones and lighting are marvelous,too. 10', '2003-07-06 23:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(348356, 26413, 6870, '<td valign="top">Oh death! Where is thy sting? This poor blossom gets one last hurrah from you in this lovely photo of its demise. Lighting and composition are simply marvelous. 9</td>', 'Oh death! Where is thy sting? This poor blossom gets one last hurrah from you in this lovely photo of its demise. Lighting and composition are simply marvelous. 9', '2003-07-06 23:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(348357, 26443, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the immediacy of this image. You chose a good subject and have done a good job at unadulterated journalistic photography.</td>', 'I like the immediacy of this image. You chose a good subject and have done a good job at unadulterated journalistic photography.', '2003-07-06 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(348358, 26691, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super point of view here, and the lighting is so soft and nice. The colors seem slightly hazy or not as saturated as they might be, but this photo still works very nicely for me.</td>', 'Super point of view here, and the lighting is so soft and nice. The colors seem slightly hazy or not as saturated as they might be, but this photo still works very nicely for me.', '2003-07-06 23:11:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(348361, 26884, 9652, '<td valign="top">Incredible focus, framing!</td>', 'Incredible focus, framing!', '2003-07-06 23:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(348362, 26938, 6870, '<td valign="top">"Feel so bad, gotta worry much. I''m so lonesome all the time. Since I left my baby behind on Blue Bayou (singing mournfully)" --Oops, GREEN Bayou. Cool subject! I love allof the little details and contrasts here between the sumptuous green and dingy grays. The photo seems not as sharp as I''d like it to me, though. Still works for me!</td>', '"Feel so bad, gotta worry much. I''m so lonesome all the time. Since I left my baby behind on Blue Bayou (singing mournfully)" --Oops, GREEN Bayou. Cool subject! I love allof the little details and contrasts here between the sumptuous green and dingy grays. The photo seems not as sharp as I''d like it to me, though. Still works for me!', '2003-07-06 23:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(348363, 26341, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, and that blade really takes the stage here. The banana plays a nice second fiddle. Swell work!</td>', 'Fun idea, and that blade really takes the stage here. The banana plays a nice second fiddle. Swell work!', '2003-07-06 23:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(348364, 26923, 6870, '<td valign="top">Hey, what bay is this? It looks familiar.... Well, the pseudo sillouettes really make this image pop for me, and I love the hazy bay and sky, so there is wonderful contrast between the foreground grass and trees and the background subject. Nice job.</td>', 'Hey, what bay is this? It looks familiar.... Well, the pseudo sillouettes really make this image pop for me, and I love the hazy bay and sky, so there is wonderful contrast between the foreground grass and trees and the background subject. Nice job.', '2003-07-06 23:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(348365, 26117, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super title, and I really think boat''s soft angle makes this shot more interesting. Lovely colors and tones, too. Seems ever so slightly not as sharp as it could perhaps be? Still works.</td>', 'Super title, and I really think boat''s soft angle makes this shot more interesting. Lovely colors and tones, too. Seems ever so slightly not as sharp as it could perhaps be? Still works.', '2003-07-06 23:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(348366, 26913, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and unique point of view that works and makes this flower shot shine. I like your use of depth of field here. Cool image. 9</td>', 'Very interesting and unique point of view that works and makes this flower shot shine. I like your use of depth of field here. Cool image. 9', '2003-07-06 23:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(348368, 26954, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice action capture!  Colors and sharpness aren''t perhaps what they could be, but you manage to really communicate the excitement of this bike.</td>', 'Nice action capture!  Colors and sharpness aren''t perhaps what they could be, but you manage to really communicate the excitement of this bike.', '2003-07-06 23:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(348369, 26318, 6870, '<td valign="top">Once they get the lox, will they eat it with bagels? I give you extra points for the groovy title, and the arrangement of the bears is wonderful. A very nice still life. Sharpness could be improved, though. But a fun photo.</td>', 'Once they get the lox, will they eat it with bagels? I give you extra points for the groovy title, and the arrangement of the bears is wonderful. A very nice still life. Sharpness could be improved, though. But a fun photo.', '2003-07-06 23:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(348371, 26914, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good enough for a cook book! Makes me hungry! Nice composition with the lighter items framing the darker burgers.</td>', 'Good enough for a cook book! Makes me hungry! Nice composition with the lighter items framing the darker burgers.', '2003-07-06 23:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(348372, 26944, 6870, '<td valign="top">Cool effect, and a fun shot.</td>', 'Cool effect, and a fun shot.', '2003-07-06 23:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(348374, 26766, 6870, '<td valign="top">The title clicks for me! I''m all for centered subjects, but in this case, it might be more effective to have put that bug on a third to enhance the feeling that it is part of a world and not the end all of the photograph. Still, I like the bug''s luminescence!</td>', 'The title clicks for me! I''m all for centered subjects, but in this case, it might be more effective to have put that bug on a third to enhance the feeling that it is part of a world and not the end all of the photograph. Still, I like the bug''s luminescence!', '2003-07-06 23:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(348375, 26929, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for nifty shots of herpetelogical specimens! DOF is just perfect to increase the sense of both size and menace! 10</td>', 'I''m a sucker for nifty shots of herpetelogical specimens! DOF is just perfect to increase the sense of both size and menace! 10', '2003-07-06 23:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(348376, 26950, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIfty nude! Is that a volcano? This photo works for me as an abstract, but also as a human form subject. Nice! 9 (egad!)</td>', 'NIfty nude! Is that a volcano? This photo works for me as an abstract, but also as a human form subject. Nice! 9 (egad!)', '2003-07-06 23:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(348377, 26828, 8159, '<td valign="top">Cute kid! But I don''t care for the inset border the goes through her hair...</td>', 'Cute kid! But I don''t care for the inset border the goes through her hair...', '2003-07-06 23:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(348378, 26376, 6870, '<td valign="top">Weird. But in a good way! Her expression, her clothes, her glasses, your composition and cropping and background. Weird. But in a good way! 8</td>', 'Weird. But in a good way! Her expression, her clothes, her glasses, your composition and cropping and background. Weird. But in a good way! 8', '2003-07-06 23:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(348379, 26814, 6870, '<td valign="top">Your use of infrared works so well here. It so often doesn''t, but this is quality stuff! 10</td>', 'Your use of infrared works so well here. It so often doesn''t, but this is quality stuff! 10', '2003-07-06 23:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(348380, 26447, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and colors here. And the perspective is marvelous on this cliff. Birds could be a tad sharper, but the overall effect is great!</td>', 'Wonderful tones and colors here. And the perspective is marvelous on this cliff. Birds could be a tad sharper, but the overall effect is great!', '2003-07-06 23:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(348381, 26825, 6870, '<td valign="top">I don''t drink beer, but that doesn''t prevent me from thinking very highly of this marvelously lit shot. Belongs in a magazine! 9</td>', 'I don''t drink beer, but that doesn''t prevent me from thinking very highly of this marvelously lit shot. Belongs in a magazine! 9', '2003-07-06 23:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(348382, 26822, 6870, '<td valign="top">B/W really sets off the textures and forms of the bubble and the face.</td>', 'B/W really sets off the textures and forms of the bubble and the face.', '2003-07-06 23:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(348383, 26933, 6870, '<td valign="top">Okay, so I''m in California, and I''m walking through this horticultural center and there''s all this bamboo and I''m taking pictures all over the place and I don''t get even one good shot--Now I can go back and copy yours and I''ll have something to be proud of! Gentle leaning lines and soft colors and light make this photo really work. Nice!</td>', 'Okay, so I''m in California, and I''m walking through this horticultural center and there''s all this bamboo and I''m taking pictures all over the place and I don''t get even one good shot--Now I can go back and copy yours and I''ll have something to be proud of! Gentle leaning lines and soft colors and light make this photo really work. Nice!', '2003-07-06 23:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(348385, 26870, 6870, '<td valign="top">You really capture the personality of this tree! I wish the details were sharper, but your composition is fantastic.</td>', 'You really capture the personality of this tree! I wish the details were sharper, but your composition is fantastic.', '2003-07-06 23:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(348386, 26779, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures and lighting here. Too bad the bug''s head is chopped off. Nice intimate nature shot.</td>', 'Wonderful textures and lighting here. Too bad the bug''s head is chopped off. Nice intimate nature shot.', '2003-07-06 23:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(348387, 26830, 6900, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  Hue shift or natural? 9</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  Hue shift or natural? 9', '2003-07-06 23:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(348388, 26690, 6870, '<td valign="top">I have to confess that I''m colorblind, so the red/green contrast doesn''t work on me here as well as it does on others. However, the lines and textures STILL make the flower the central subject, and the photo still works pretty well for me. 8</td>', 'I have to confess that I''m colorblind, so the red/green contrast doesn''t work on me here as well as it does on others. However, the lines and textures STILL make the flower the central subject, and the photo still works pretty well for me. 8', '2003-07-06 23:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(348389, 26097, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice background and good lighting on the seagull. I wish he (or she) were a little sharper in focus, and the fence competes for his attention. Still, he retains a lot because of this marvelous light.</td>', 'Nice background and good lighting on the seagull. I wish he (or she) were a little sharper in focus, and the fence competes for his attention. Still, he retains a lot because of this marvelous light.', '2003-07-06 23:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(348390, 26952, 6870, '<td valign="top">Cool point of view and I love the camera tilt. Contrasts and colors are SOOO nice here. 10</td>', 'Cool point of view and I love the camera tilt. Contrasts and colors are SOOO nice here. 10', '2003-07-06 23:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(348391, 26844, 6870, '<td valign="top">Marvelous compositoin and candid capture make this photo soar for me. 9</td>', 'Marvelous compositoin and candid capture make this photo soar for me. 9', '2003-07-06 23:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(348392, 26208, 8159, '<td valign="top">I hate smoking, but for some reason, I like this picture...</td>', 'I hate smoking, but for some reason, I like this picture...', '2003-07-06 23:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(348393, 26855, 8159, '<td valign="top">The reflection totally makes this shot. Very well done.</td>', 'The reflection totally makes this shot. Very well done.', '2003-07-06 23:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(348396, 26387, 806, '<td valign="top">decent subject.. too out of focus... perhaps making it a bit off center would add more drama.</td>', 'decent subject.. too out of focus... perhaps making it a bit off center would add more drama.', '2003-07-06 23:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
