(348520, 26814, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Very pretty, has a relaxing and calming effect.  Well done. The focus, dof and colors here are really good. Leaves me wondering what it looks like in color. <br/> <br/>It really is well done and there aren''t to many changes I would make to it.  Actually only thing that really stands out is a few leaves on the bottom right could be spot edited to tone them down a touch they appear over exposed as they are.<br/> <br/>Again nicely done and definately meets the challenge.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', '*Critique Club* Very pretty, has a relaxing and calming effect.  Well done. The focus, dof and colors here are really good. Leaves me wondering what it looks like in color.  It really is well done and there aren''t to many changes I would make to it.  Actually only thing that really stands out is a few leaves on the bottom right could be spot edited to tone them down a touch they appear over exposed as they are. Again nicely done and definately meets the challenge. Anna', '2003-07-07 01:46:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(348524, 26895, 6870, '<td valign="top">I wonder if folks didn''t realize that Bountiful is the name of a city? This should have done much better, Jeremy. If they thought it was just an adjective that started with B...</td>', 'I wonder if folks didn''t realize that Bountiful is the name of a city? This should have done much better, Jeremy. If they thought it was just an adjective that started with B...', '2003-07-07 01:47:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(348535, 26924, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critiqe Corner*<br/> <br/>When I first looked at it I thought the focus was horrible then I took a second glance and realized you used a very selective focus on this.  I''m actually here wondering if you may have done this in macro.<br/> <br/>The one thing I might change on this whole image is the placement of the sliver ribbon it seems to be cutting the bell in half and could easily be corrected.<br/> <br/>Over all it is a prety cool photo when you really look at it and think about it.  Very nice keepsake too for the bride and groom.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', '*Critiqe Corner* When I first looked at it I thought the focus was horrible then I took a second glance and realized you used a very selective focus on this.  I''m actually here wondering if you may have done this in macro. The one thing I might change on this whole image is the placement of the sliver ribbon it seems to be cutting the bell in half and could easily be corrected. Over all it is a prety cool photo when you really look at it and think about it.  Very nice keepsake too for the bride and groom. Anna', '2003-07-07 01:55:21.000000', NULL, 0),
