(349478, 26778, 6349, '<td valign="top">Hey!  You are the proud recepient of my "you got screwed" after-challenge comment.  This fine award goes to the lowest scoring image that I gave an 8 or higher in the competition.  Keep up the good work and don''t let your score get you down.  Your black and white spot edited version was awesome by the way, I would have given it a 10.</td>', 'Hey!  You are the proud recepient of my "you got screwed" after-challenge comment.  This fine award goes to the lowest scoring image that I gave an 8 or higher in the competition.  Keep up the good work and don''t let your score get you down.  Your black and white spot edited version was awesome by the way, I would have given it a 10.', '2003-07-07 19:29:44.000000', NULL, 0),
