(349801, 26817, 6696, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all that took the time to comment on this submission. I can hardly believe that I have earned a second ribbon in as many weeks.  It may be luck, but I''d like to think that it has to do with what I am learning from many of my fellow DPC addicts.  Perhaps I will be lucky enough to complete the set and win a red ribbon one day!  Thanks again!<br/></td>', 'Thanks to all that took the time to comment on this submission. I can hardly believe that I have earned a second ribbon in as many weeks.  It may be luck, but I''d like to think that it has to do with what I am learning from many of my fellow DPC addicts.  Perhaps I will be lucky enough to complete the set and win a red ribbon one day!  Thanks again!', '2003-07-08 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
