(350159, 26949, 8981, '<td valign="top">Wow! I really like this photo!  The depth with the water on the sand, the sand itself and the breaking wave is great!  The water looks like it was caught at exactly the right moment.  If I could have voted I definatly would have given you a 9 or a 10.</td>', 'Wow! I really like this photo!  The depth with the water on the sand, the sand itself and the breaking wave is great!  The water looks like it was caught at exactly the right moment.  If I could have voted I definatly would have given you a 9 or a 10.', '2003-07-08 13:29:37.000000', NULL, 0),
