(1873184, 26952, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really a cool picture of the Dunes, Robert - I''ve never seen one like it &amp; I''ve seen LOTS of pictures of the Dunes (and have taken lots)since we have lived so close to them for 27 years. Next time we''re there I''m going to try something like this! Very original and unique.</td>', 'This is really a cool picture of the Dunes, Robert - I''ve never seen one like it & I''ve seen LOTS of pictures of the Dunes (and have taken lots)since we have lived so close to them for 27 years. Next time we''re there I''m going to try something like this! Very original and unique.', '2005-11-16 13:14:50.000000', NULL, 0),
